<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matendu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kihitabu kya matendu handa kiyandikilwi na Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matendu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Matendu gha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wandumindumi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu kya matendu gha wandumindumi ni habali zya mtumbulo gha wavulwa na vila injili ilandalili kuhuma Yelusalemu mbaka Yudasia, Samalia na hata mwihu wa Mlima wogha, handa vila Yesu awalongelili wavulwa ghaki lipindi pambila kuyenda kundumba 1: 8. Kihitabu haki kiyandikilwi na Lukasi vilavila hayu ayandikili Injili gha Lukasi. Lukasi avile dakitali na ayandikili kwa umaha. Ayandikili vyogha Injili gha Lukasi na hitabu kya Matendu gha wandumindumi kwa Teofili, avile ni Mgiliki, Ila hitabu haki lukani lyaki kwa konganiko lya wakilisito wala Wagiliki pamonga na Wayahudi 1:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kihitabu haki kya Matendu kiyandikilwi lipindi machuva 60-64 badili gha Yesu kuwelekwa, kwaikiva hitabu kivikili mwihu pambila Paulo kulekwa kuhuma kuuwopwa. Lukasi vilavila ayendili pamonga na mndumindumi Paulo na ayandikili hitabu haki kummbwani Anitiokia. Matendu ni myendelelo wa injili gha Lukasi na mtumbulo wa Yesu kuyenda kundumba. Lukasi lukani lyaki lya kuyandika handa lila lya Injili ghaki. Apalili Teofilo, vilavila na kuyongeseka kwa wakilisito wavile na mavulo ku mayandiko na ayandikili kwa uchakaka vila Yesu atamili na vila ukilisito ulandalili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hitabu kya matendu kingutuvula mlandano vila lipinga lya wamkwinila kilisito lya mtumbulo na vila gha kulama kwa kumkwinila Yesu. Kwa mlandano wa wandumindumi ungutulangiha twenga vila kukwinila makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga kungulandala Habali Maha kwa wandu ghangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Mpumulo wa Sapanga anguhika kwa Wavulwa na lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila kilisito lingutumbula kukula 1:1-8:1</para>
  <para style="io">Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito linguhakilwa na litumbuli kulandalili Yelusalemu 8:2-12:23</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo atumbula mwanja ghaki gha kutangasa Habali Maha, 12:24-14:28</para>
  <para style="io">Njengakaya lakonganika ku Yelusalemu kulamula kyani wakwinila ghangi wagholi 15:1-35</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyenda mwanja ghaki gha ivili gha kutangasa Habali Maha 15:36-18:22</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyenda mwanja gha itatu kutangasa Habali Maha 18:23-20:38</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angukamulwa Yelusalemu 21:1-26:32</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguyeghwa ku Loma 27:1-28:31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Kwa wenga Teofili. Kukihitabu nikitumbulili kuyandika, niyandikili mighalu hyogha Yesu agholili kuhuma mtumbulo mbaka kumwihu, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka lichuwa lila atolilwi kundumba. Badili gha kuwapegha malaghililo kupitila Mpumulo wa Sapanga wala wandumindumi awahaghulili. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kwa machuwa ialobaini badili gha kihu kyaki mweni awahumilili mihanja itangala kwa njila ihighilisa lipala yiwa kamkomu. Wakamlola na mweni alongilili na weni mighalu gha unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Paawelili akilyegha na weni akawalongela nagha, “Mkotoho kuhuka Yelusalemu, ila mlindili hila hupo awalaghilili Tati, hila muyoghanilili nikilonga kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohanaabatisili kwa masi, ila kwa machuwa mayaghani yahika, mwenga mtebatiswa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanganesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutolwa kuyenda kundumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliku 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Lipindi wavulwa wakongine pamonga na Yesu, wakamkonya, “Ghuli, Bambu, lipindi hali ndiwa utehuyisa hula unkosi kwa Izilaili?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu akawalongela, “Machuwa na lipindi gha mighalu hagha vya pahi gha ulongosi wa Tati gha nenga, hinu lihengu lya mwenga ng'ogha kumanya yatehumila lipindi ligha. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ila lipindi Mpumulo wa Sapanga paawahulukila mwenga, mtepokela makakala na mtewela wandu mlolile kwa mihu na kulongela ku Yelusalemu, kumlima gha Yudasia hyogha na Samalia na hata mwihu wa mlima wogha.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Paayomola kulonga ghala, wogha wakiva wangulola, akatolwa kuyenda kundumba, lihindu likamhigha wakotoho kumlola kangi.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pawawelili wangukwenjula mihu kulola kunani, mweni akiyenda zyaki, bwitu wandu waivili wawelili wavala nguu mbulete pee wakagholoka pabehi na weni, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />wakalonga, “Mwenga wandu wa Galilaya. Kwa kyani mngugholoka baha mkilola kunani? Yesu hayu avile atolilwi kuhuma kwa mwenga kuyenda kundumba atehika kangi handa nagha mumlola akiyenda kundumba.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matia anguhaghuliwa kutola fasi gha Yudasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Hinu wandumindumi wakahuya Yelusalemu kuhuma hula mtumbi ukemilwi mtumbi wa mizeituni uvile utali ghaki kilomita imonga kuhuma kummbwani Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pawahikili kummbwani Yelusalemu wayingilili kukyumba golofani pahala wavile wangulikala, na wawelili Petelo na Yohanana Yakobu na Andelea na Filipo na Tomasu na Batolomayo na Matayu na Yakobu mwana wa Alifayo na Simoni Zelote na Yudasi mwana wa Yakobu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Hagha wogha wayendelelili kukongine na kuyupa pamonga na wadala, na Malia nyongo ghaki Yesu, na walongu zyaki.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Lichuwa limonga kumachuwa ghala, Petelo akagholoka paghati gha wala walongu wayitikila wakonganilili, wogha wavile wandu imia na ihishilini, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Petelo akalonga, “Walongu ghangu, ingupalwa Mayandiko yatimili, ghala Mpumulo wa Sapanga ailongile ghala yategholwa na Sapanga, kwa milandu gha Daudi, kwa habali zya Yudasi yula awalongolili wala wamkamulili Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yudasi awelili mmonga wa lipinga lyetu, kwaikiva na mweni ahaghulilwi na Yesu pamonga na twenga kulihengu hali.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Mweni ahemelili litawa kwa ghala mapesa apokelili kwa kughola kitendu kyaki kihakata, akaguwila mula mulitawa kifulifuli, akabaluka na matumbu ghaki ghakamwaghika panji. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Wandu wogha walikalili Yelusalemu wakayoghanila habali zya mghalu hau, hinu kwa luga ghao, wakalikema lila litawa “Akelidama,” ingumanyika hali ni “Litawa lya Mwahi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Petelo akalonga, “Iyandikwa kuhitabu kya Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Makaya ghaki patami wekaghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">mundu yoyose akotoho likala mghati ghaki.” Kangi iyandikilwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“Mundu ghangi atole lihengu lyaki lya kughola.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Hinu, ingupalwa mundu mmonga paghati gha wala watyangili na twenga lipindi lyogha Bambu Yesu paawelili angutyanga pamonga na twenga ahaghuliwi kukongana na twenga. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Hayu angupalwa avile mmonga wa wandu wawelili pamonga na twenga kuhuma Yohanaangubatisa mbaka lichuwa lila Yesu atolilwi kuhuma kwa twenga na kuyenda kundumba. Hayu ateghola pamonga na twenga lihengu lya kulongela kwa wandu uhinduki wa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Hinu, wakahaghula kuvika mahina gha wandu waivili, wa mtumbula Yosefu akemilwi Balisaba vilavila akemilwi Yusito, na wa ivili ni Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Hinu wakayupa, “Bambu wenga ungumanya mawachilo gha mioyu gha wandu wogha. Nagha, utulangihi ni ghani paghati gha hagha waivili umhaghulili, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ili atoli fasi hai gha kutumikila alilekili Yudasi akayenda mahala angupalwa alikali.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Wakahinisa mihu gha mlungu; na wahaghula wogha wakamhaghula Matia, na mweni akayongeswa kulipinga lya wala wandumindumi ikumi na imonga.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kuhika kwa Mpumulo mbuletenesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Lichuwa lya mhambu wa Pendekositi palihika, wala wamkwinila Yesu wogha walikungulili mahala pamonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Bwitu, lilowi likayughanika kuhuma kunani, lilowi livile handa liyegha likalipa linguwumba, likaimemesa lila lighuta lyogha wawelili walikala. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Hinu, vikahumila vindu viwoneka handa mivalika gha lyoto na vyeni vikilandala na kumuhulukila kila mmonga ghao. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wogha wakamemeswa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, wakatumbula kulonga luga ghangi handa Mpumulo vila kawawesesa.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Na kula Yelusalemu walikalili Wayahudi, wandu hagha wawelili wangumtundamila na kumyitikila Sapanga na wahumili kumilima wekaweka mlima wogha. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pawayoghanila lilowi lila, lipinga likulunga lya wandu likalikungula. Wogha walikangasili nesu kwaikiva kila mmonga wa weni ahyoghanilili luga zyao zya kuwelekwa zikilongelwa na wala watumikila wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Wakalikala lolowa na kulikangasa wakilonga, “Ghuli, hagha wogha tunguwayoghanila wakilonga nagha, wenikaya wa Galilaya ng'ogha? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Yiwaghuli, kila mmonga wa twenga anguwahyoghanila wakilonga kwa luga yaki gha kuwelekwa? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamonga wa twenga wahuma ku Apati na Amedi na Elamu, ghangi ni wenikaya wa Mesopotamia na Yudasia na Kapadokia na Ponto na Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />na Fulugia na Pamfilia na Misili na amonga gha mimbwani gha Libia pabehi na Kulene, wamonga ghangi ni wahenja kuhuma ku Ulumi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Wayahudi na wandu wa milima ghangi wayingilili mudini gha Kiyahudi, wamonga wahumili ku Kilete na Arabia. Twenga wogha tunguwayoghanila wakilonga mighalu mikulunga gha Sapanga kwa luga gha twenga baha!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wogha wakakangaswa na wakalikala lolowa kunu wangukonyana, “Haki niki tungikiyoghanila?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ila wamonga wakawadanila wala watumikila wa Sapanga wakilonga, “Wandu hagha walowile dongela.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo anguwatangasila wandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Hinu Petelo akagholoka pamonga na wala wandumindumi ikumi na imonga na kutumbula kuwalongela wandu kwa lilowi likulunga, “Walongu Wayahudi na mwenga wogha mlikala baha Yelusalemu, myoghanile kwa umaha haki nitewalongela.” <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Chakaka wandu hagha walowela ng'ogha handa mliwachila, kwaikiva ni saa itatu hela malawila. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Uchakaka ni hau mghalu hau ni hula ulongilwi na Yoeli mlota wa Sapanga,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Kumachuwa gha mwihu, alonga Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nitewayitila wandu wogha Upumulo wa nenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wana wa mwenga walumi na wadala watewalongela wandu Habali ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wahongolo wa mwenga watelola mawono na wagogolo wa mwenga watelota liloto.”<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Hina, hata kwa watumikila wa nenga walumi na wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nitewayitila Mpumulo wa nenga machuwa ghala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">na weni watelonga Habali ghangu. <verse eid="ACT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Niteghola makangaso kunani mwa mahindu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na kilangihi pahi mumlimawogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kutekuwela na mwahi na lyoto na lyohi litopehu, <verse eid="ACT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />lijuwa litetaywa lwisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na mwehi utevile mkele handa mwahi, pambila gha kuhika lila lichuwa ngulunga na kwilikihi gha Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />“Mundu yoyose atekuyupa kwa lihina lya Bambu atelokoka.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Petelo akayendelela kulonga, “Mwenga wandu wa Izilaili, mhyoghanili milandu hagha kwa umaha! Sapanga awalangilili mwenga yiwa angughola lihengu kwa kupitila Yesu wa Nazaleti. Mwenga wenibaha mngumanya yiwa kupitila Yesu ndiwa alaghilili vilangihi vya wekaweka kwa mwenga.” <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Sapanga ayandalili kala lukani lwaki yiwa Yesu atekamulwa na kuvikwa kumawoko gha wandu wahakata na mwenga mkamkoma kwa kumvamba kulipingika. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ila Sapanga amhindulili Yesu kuhuma kuwahovili, akamkombola kumahakili gha kihu kwa ikiva ivile yuyughu ng'ogha kwa mweni kuwopwa na kihu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwaikiva Daudi alongilili mighalu ghaki nagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">“Nimwonilili Bambu kuulongolo ghangu machuwa hyogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">avile na nenga upandi ghangu wa kuliyila hinu nitevile ng'ogha na holu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kwa nagha, moyu ghangu unguhekelela;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">kangi ninguhekelela kwa mlomu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">hinu higha ghangu utelikala kwa ukwinila. <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Kwaikiva uteuleka ng'ogha upumulo ghangu kumlima wa wahovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">hilahila kumleka mmbulete nesu ghako awole haku kulimambi.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wenga unilangilile njila zya ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">utenipegha luheku nesu panivile pamonga na wenga.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Walongo ghangu Waizilaili, ningupala kuwalongela lipalalipala mighalu imkolili Daudi, mbuyi wa twenga. Mweni akahova na kusikwa, kangi limambi lyaki livile baha kwa twenga mbaka lelu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ila kwaikiva Daudi awelili mlota wa Sapanga, amanyili yiwa Sapanga amlaghilili na kumlapila kilapo atemvika mmonga wa wawelekwa ghaki kukikalilo kyaki kya unkosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi alolili kuulongolo mighalu itegholwa na Sapanga na kangi akalongelela kuhinduka kwa Kilisito pala paalongili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">“Alekilwi ng'ogha kumlima wa wahovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">na higha ghaki uwolili ng'ogha kulimambi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Hinu, Sapanga amuhindulili hayu Yesu na twenga wogha ni wandu tulola kwa mihu mghalu hula. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Badili gha Tati Sapanga kumpegha utundamilo mkulu kupiti wogha akapokela Mpumulo Mbuletenesu kuhuma kwa Tati, katuyeghela Mpumulo Mbuletenesu yula Sapanga alongilile yiwa atetuyeghela. Ndiwa hagha mnguyalola na kuyayoghanila. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwaikiva Daudi mweni baha, katolwa ng'ogha kuyenda kundumba, ila mweni ailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">“Bambu wa twenga Sapanga amlongelili Bambu ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">tama upandi ghangu wa kuliyila.” <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />“Mbaka niwaviki wahakata ghako pahi gha maghulu ghako.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Petelo akalonga, “Wandu wogha wa Izilaili wangupalwa kumanya kwa umaha yiwa hayu Yesu mumvambili, ndiwa hayu Sapanga amgholili kuvile Bambu na Kilisito Mkombola.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Hinu, wandu pawayoghanila milandu hila, wahomilwi kumioyu ghao, wakawakonya Petelo na wala wandumindumi ghangi, “Walongo wa twenga, tughole kyani?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petelo akayanga, “Kila mmonga wa mwenga aleki uhakata na kumkovekela Sapanga na kangi abatiswi kwa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito. Na Sapanga atekulekesela uhakata ghako. Na kupokela lila lilaghano lya Sapanga avile yula Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwaikiva lilaghano lila ni kwa mwenga na wana wa mwenga na wogha wavile kutali na wala wogha Bambu Sapanga atewakema.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petelo akawalongela kwa milandu ghangi mitopehu akilonga, “Mjilokoli kuhuma kukiwelekwa haki kihakata!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Lichuwa lila wandu watangala wakwinilili habali zya Petelo, wakabatiswa. Na wandu ielufu itatu wakayongeseka mulipinga lya wakwinila wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wogha wayendilelili kuivula kuhuma kwa wandumindumi wa Yesu, kulikala pamonga kiulongu, kulyegha mulyo pamonga na kuyupa.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vila walikala wala Wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Kila mmonga akakangaswa na Makangaso yatangala yagholilwi na wandumindumi hata kila mundu akamtundamila Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wakwinila wogha wayendilelili kulikala pamonga na vindu ghao wapeghanilili. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Wahusili vindu ghao na kupeghana mapesa kulandana na kila kipungula kwa kila mmonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Wayendilelili kukongana pamonga kila lelu Mlighuta lya Sapanga ila lipindi lya kulyegha mulyo, wakonganili mumaghuta ghao na kulyegha kwa luheku na moyu ukiva pekesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Wamuyinulili Sapanga, wakapalwa na wandu wogha. Kila lelu Bambu awayongiselili wandu walokolile.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petelo na Yohanawangumlamisa mlemafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lichuwa limonga, saa itisa lumihi, Petelo na Yohanawawelili wakiyenda Mlighuta lya Sapanga, na hali ndiwa liwelili lipindi lya kumtundamila Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Na kula Mlighuta lya Sapanga kuwelili na mundu mmonga mlemafu kuhuma kuuwelekwa. Na kila lelu kuwelili na wandu wavile wakimtola na kumvika hayu mundu kumlyangu mkulu wa Lighuta lya Sapanga waukemili “Mlyango mmaha,” ili aluwi chochose kwa wala wawelili wakiyingila Mulighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Paawawonili Petelo na Yohanawakiyingila Mlighuta lya Sapanga, akawaluwa wampeghi chochose. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petelo na Yohanawalimtumbulila mihu, na Petelo akamlongela, “Tulole.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Na mweni akawalola, akiwachila atepokela hindu kuhuma kwa weni. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Hinu Petelo akamlongela, “Nahela lidini lya feza na nahela lidini lya zahabu, ila kila nikikola nitekupegha. Kwa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito wa Nazaleti, uyinuki na utyangi.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Hinu Petelo, akamkola liwoko lya kuliyila, akamyinula, palapala maghulu na vighughulumbi ghaki vikapokela makakala. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akajumba, akagholoka na kutumbula kutyanga, kangi akayingila pamonga na weni Mulighuta lya Sapanga, akityanga na kujumbajumba kunu akimyinula Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wandu wogha wawelili pala wamwonili akityanga na kumyinula Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Wandu pawammanyili ndiwa yula awelili anguluwaluwa pabehi na hula mlyango mmaha wa Mlighuta lya Sapanga. wakakangaswa nesu hata wawesiling'ogha kumanya yamkolili.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angulongela yiwa Yesu angulamisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Yula mundu mlemafu alamisilwi paawelili akilongosana na Petelo na Yohana, wandu wogha walikangasili nesu wakahika kwa kubhutuka mbaka kulyugha lya Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Hinu, Petelo paawalolili wandu wala akawalongela, “Wandu wa Izilaeli, kwa kyani mngukangaswa na mghalu hau? Kwa kyani mngututumbulila mihu handa vila tumghola kwa makakala gha twenga au ulungwana wa twenga baha tumghola mundu hayu awesi kutyanga?” <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Sapanga wa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu, Sapanga wa tati wa twenga, kamyinula mtumikila ghaki Yesu. Ila mwenga mumkamulili ili akomwi na kumlema kuulongolo gha Pilato hata badili gha Pilato kulamula kumleka ayendi zyaki. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Awelili mundu wa Sapanga na mweni umaha, ila mwenga mumlemili, mkamhaghula mundu ghangi awelili mkoma wandu awoposolwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Hinu, mkamkoma yula avile ni mtumbulo wa ukomu. Ila Sapanga akamuhindula, na twenga ni wandu tulola kwa mihu mghalu hau. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwa kulikwinila lihina lya Yesu ndiwa vikongonu vya mundu hayu vipokela makakala mundu hayu mngumlola na kummanya. Kukwinila kwaki kwa kumkwinila Yesu ndiwa kumlamisa chakaka mundu hayu handa mumlola mwenga wogha. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Hinaa walongu ghangu ningumanya yiwa mwenga na wakulu wa mwenga mgholili ghala kwaikiva gha kumanya ng'ogha kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ila havi ndiwa Sapanga agholili ghala ayalongelili dahile kwa kupitila walota wogha, yiwa ingupalwa Kilisito ghaki ahakilwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Hinu, mleki uhakata na mumhyukile Sapanga ili mweni awalekeseli mahakata gha mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mgholi nagha ili Bambu awapeghi lipindi lya luheku mumioyu gha mwenga na kuwapegha yula Kilisito amhaghulili na mweni ndiwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ingupalwa mweni atami haku kundumba mbaka lihiki lipindi lya kughola kangi hyonu vindu vyogha, handa Sapanga alongelili kwa kupitila walota ghaki wambuletenesu wa kuhuma dahile. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kwaikiva Musa alongili, ‘Bambu Sapanga wa mwenga atewayinulila mlota handa kaniyegha nenga na atevile mmonga paghati gha mwenga baha na mhyoghanili hyogha atewalongela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Mundu yoyose yula kamhyoghanila ng'ogha mlota hayu atevile ng'ogha mundu wa Sapanga na ateyalamiswa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Walota wa Sapanga wogha, kuhumila Samweli na wala wahikili kuulongolo na mweni, wailongile ghala Sapanga ateyaghola na ni hagha yangugholeka machuwa hinaa. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Lilaghano lila Sapanga alongelili kwa kupitila walota ghaki ni kwaikiva gha mwenga, na mngulihi pamonga lila lilaghano lya Sapanga aligholili na mambuyi wa mwenga, handa amlongelili Ibulahimu, ‘Kwa kupitila wawelekwa ghako, walongu wogha wa mlima wogha watehighilwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Hinu, Sapanga paamhindulili Yesu mwana ghaki amyeghili kwa mwenga mtumbula, ili awahighili kwa kumghola kila mmonga wa mwenga aleki kughola mahakata ghaki.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petelo na Yohanawanguyeghwa kunjengakaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petelo na Yohanapawawelili wakiyendelela kulongela na wandu, watambika na mkulu wa watovangondo wa lighuta lya Sapanga pamonga na Masadukayo wakahika. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wandu hagha wawelili na lilaka nesu, kwaikiva wala wandumindumi waivili wawelili wanguwavula wandu yiwa Yesu ahindukili, mghalu hau ungulangiha lipala yiwa wahovili watehinduka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kwa nagha wakawakamula Petelo na Yohanana kuwavika muuwopwa mbaka kilau ghaki kwaikiva uhiku uwelili upabehi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ila wandu watangala paghati gha wala wayoghanilili ujumbi ghao hula waulongili Petelo na Yohanawakwinilili, na lipinga lya wavulwa likayongeseka na kuhika pabehi walumi ielufu itano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Kilau ghaki, vilongosi wa Wayahudi, wagogolo na wavula wa laghililo gha Musa wakongine pamonga kula Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />kunjengakaya hai kuwelili na Anasi mtambika mkulu na Kayafa na Yohanana Alekisanda na wamonga wa ukolu wa mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pawawagholokesha wandumindumi kuulongolo ghao, wakawakonya, “Mwenga mghola mghalu hau kwa ulongosi gha ghani na kwa lihina lya ghani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Hinu kunu Petelo akilongoswa na Mpumulo Mbuletenesu, akayanga, “Mwenga vilongosi na wagogolo wa wandu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />ikiva mngutukonya lelu kwa lilando lya mghalu maha agholelilwi yula mundu awelili mlemafu na vila alamilwi, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />kwa nagha, mwenga wogha pamonga na Waizilaili wogha mmanyi maheli yiwa mundu hayu angugholoka kuulongolo gha mwenga akiva kalama chakaka, ni kwa uweso wa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito wa Nazaleti, hayu Yesu mumvambili kunani gha lipingika, ila Sapanga kamuhindula. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Hayu ndiwa yula mayandiko mambuletenesu yangulongela havi kwa mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Liganga lilekilwi na mwenga wachengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">liwela hinaa liganga lya maha lya kitumbulo kya lighuta.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kwahela ulokola kupitila mundu ghangi yoyose, kwaikiva kwahela lihina ghangi lipiti Yesu pahi gha ndumba tupeghilwi wandu tutewesa kulokolwa kwa lyeni.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Wala wagogolo wa njengakaya, pawalolile yiwa Petelo na Yohanawawelili wandu wasoma ng'ogha na wavile ng'ogha na mavulo yoyose, walikangasili nesu kwa kulola vila wailongile kwa kuikwinila. Wakamanya yiwa wawelili wavulwa wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ila pawamwonili yula mundu alamilwi kagholoka pamonga na Petelo na Yohana, wakalepelelwa kulonga chochose. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Nagha, wakawalaghila wahuki panji gha lighuta lya njengakaya, na weni wakayendelela kutama mghati wakilonga weni kwa weni. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Wakakonyana, “Tughole kyani na wandu hagha? Wandu wogha walikala Yelusalemu wangumanya yiwa mghalu hau wa kukangasa ugholilwi na weni na twenga tuwesa ng'ogha kulema mghalu hula. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ila ili tuwesi kulemesa mghalu hau ukotoho yendelela nesu paghati gha wandu, ingupalwa tuwakanisi wakotoho kulonga na mundu yoyose kwa lihina lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Hinu wakawakema kangi mghati na kuwalongela wakotoho kulonga na kuvula kwa lihina lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ila Petelo na Yohanawakawayanga, “Mulamuli mwenga baha ikiva ni umaha kuulongolo gha Sapanga kuwatundamila mwenga au kumtundamila Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ila twenga tuwesa ng'ogha kuleka kulonga mighalu hila tuilolili na tuyoghanilili.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Hinu, wagogolo wa njengakaya wakawalongela kwa kukalipa nesu, ila kumwihu wakawaleka wayende. Wawesa ng'ogha kuwahakili kwaikiva wandu wogha wawelili wakimtundamila Sapanga kwa ghala yahumilili. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Hayu mundu alamisilwi awelili na machuva yapiti ialobaini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wamkwinila Yesu wanguyupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pawalekwa wayende, Petelo na Yohanawakahuya kwa wayao, wakawalongela yala walongelilwi na watambika wakulu na wagogolo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Na weni wala wamkwinila Yesu pawayoghanila habali zila wakakongana pamonga kumyupa Sapanga wakilonga, “Bambu, wenga ni mghola kundumba na mlima wogha, na bahali na vyogha vivile mumu!” <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Wenga ulongile milandu hagha kwa kupitila Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwa mlomo wa mtumikila ghako tati gha twenga Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“Kwa kyani wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wanguhyoma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">na kwa kyani wandu wanguwachila kughola mighalu gha maha ng'ogha?” <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />“Wankosi wa mlima wogha wangujiyandala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">wakulu wangukongana pamonga wapati kumhyuka Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na Kilisito amhaghulili.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Na ndiwa inguwoneka, nkosi Helodi na Ponitio Pilato wakonganikili kummbwani hau wa Yelusalemu pamonga na Waizilaili na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha kwa kughola mawachilo gha maha kwa Yesu, mtumikila ghako Mbuletenesu yula umvikili avile Kilisito ahaghulilwi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Chakaka weni, wakonginili ili wagholi mighalu hila uliwachilili kuhuma mtumbulo igholeki kwa uweso wa wenga na mapalo ghako. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ila hinaa, wenga Bambu, uloli vila wangututaya holu. Hinu utuwesesi twenga watumikila ghako kuilongela habali ghako kwa makakala makulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ututangi ili tuwesi kughola makangaso gha wekaweka kwa kupitila lihina lya Yesu mtumikila ghako Mbuletenesu.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pawayomolili kuyupa, pala mahala wawelili wakonganila pakatikanilwa, na wogha wakalongoswa na Mpumulo Mbuletenesu. Wogha wakatumbula kutangasa lilando lya Sapanga kwa holu ng'ogha.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamkwinila Yesu wangulikala handa walongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Wandu wogha wamkwinili yesu wawelili na moyu na mawachilo mamonga. Hinu kwahela hata mmonga ailongile chochose awelili nachu ni hindu ghaki mweni, ila wapeghanili vyogha wavikamulili. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Wandumindumi wakatangasa uhinduki wa Bambu Yesu kwa makakala nesu na Sapanga akawahighila nesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Pakawela ng'ogha mundu yoyose mulipinga lyao kahela kindu, kwaikiva wogha wakolili matawa au lighuta wayesili kuwusa na kuyegha mapesa gha kila wawelili wakiwusa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kuwapegha wandumindumi mapesa ghala, na kila mmonga apeghilwi kwa kulola lung'ai ghaki.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kuwelili na mlawi mmonga, muwelekwa wa Kupulo, lihina lyake Yusufu, yula avile wandumindumi wamkemili Balinaba, ingumanyika, “Mundu wa kutuvika moyu,” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Na mweni hilahila awelili na litawa lyaki akaliwusa, akayegha mapesa, na kuwapegha wandumindumi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Uhwangi wa Anania na Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kuwelili mundu mmonga wamkema Anania na mdala ghaki Safila wawusili litawa lyao. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ila Anania na mdala ghaki walaghine kuhigha amonga gha mapesa ghala na kuyegha zila zihighala kwa wandumindumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Hinu, Petelo akamkonya, “Anania, kwa kyani ulilekili Lihyukana liyingili mmoyu ghako ili kumlongela uhwangi Mpumulo Mbuletenesu, kwa kuhigha simonga gha mapesa upokelili kuhuma kulitawa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Lipindi unguliwachila kuwusa lila litawa liwela ng'ogha litawa lyako? Na badili gha kuliwusa, hilahila hagha mapesa upokelili ungatumila ng'ogha vila upalili? Hinu kwa kyani uliwachilili kughola mghalu hau? ulongela ng'ogha ughwangi kuulongolo gha wandu ila kuulongolo gha Sapanga!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bahala Anania paahyoghanila nagha, akaguwa pahi, akahova. Wandu wogha wayoghanilili lilando lila watilili nesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wahongolo wakahika, wakagubika higha ghaki sanda, wakauhumisa panji, wakayenda kuusika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Iwachilwa saa itatu kuulongolo mdala ghaki Anania na mweni akayingila mula mghati, akiva kamanya ng'ogha mghalu uhumilili. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petelo akamkonya, “Unilongeli! Ghuli mapesa hagha ndiwa hyogha mpokelili kwa kuwusa lila litawa?” Mweni akamyanga, “Hina, ni hagha hela.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Hinu Petelo akamkonya, “Kwa kyani mlaghine na mlumi ghako kumyesa Mpumulo wa Bambu? Ulolayi! Wala wandu wayendili kumsika mlumi ghako, hinaa wagholoka kumlyangu na watekutola na wenga kangi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Palapala akahova na akaguila kumaghulu gha Petelo. Wala wahongolo pawayingilili, wakamlola kahova kala, hinu wakamuhumisa panji, wakayenda kumsika pabehi na mlumi ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Holu ngulu ikawahumila lipinga limkwinila Kilisito na wogha wayoghanilili mghalu hula wakatila.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandumindumi wangulamisa wandu watangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wandumindumi wagholili vilaghihi na makangaso yatangala paghati mwa wandu. Wandu wogha wamkwinila Yesu wawelili wakikongana pamonga kulyugha lya Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Wandu wala wamkwinila ng'ogha Yesu wawelili wakiwajumila nesu, hata nagha kwahela mundu ayesili kuwakovekela kwaikiva gha kutila. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Hata nagha wandu wamkwinila Yesu wakayongeseka, walumi kwa wadala, wayongesekili nesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Hata wandu wawelili wakiwayegha wavina munjila na kuwawonjesa kunani gha vindanda na mahinda ili Petelo paapitili, kisisi kyaki kiwesi kuwayavisa na kuwalamisa. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Wandu watangala walihika kuhuma kumimbwani itindila Yelusalemu, wakiwayegha wavina ghao na wala wawelili na mahoka, na wogha wakalama.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandumindumi wa Yesu wanguhakilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Hinu, mtambika mkulu na wayake wawelili wa lipinga lya Masadukayo wa mahala pala, wakawalonela wandumindumi wifu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Hinu, wakawakamula wandumindumi na kuwayegha muuwopwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ila uhiku mtumikila wa kundumba wa Bambu akafughula milyango mikulu gha muuwopwa, akawayegha panji, akawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Myendi mkagholoki ku lyugha lya Lighuta lya Sapanga mkawalongeli wandu milandu hyogha gha ukomu hau.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ndiwa Wandumindumi wakayenda ku Lighuta lya Sapanga malawila pee na wakatumbula kuvula wandu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mtambika mkulu na wayaki wakahika wakaikema njengakaya hyogha gha wagogolo wa Izilaili hinu wakalaghila wagholokela wa Lighuta lya wawopwa kulighuta lya wawopwa wawayeghi wala wandumindumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ila wala wagholokela pawahikili kula, wawalolili ng'ogha wandumindumi wa Yesu na weni wakayihuyila. wakalongela kila wakilolile kula kulighuta lya wawopwa ku njengakaya. <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Wakalonga, “Tulolile lighuta lya wawopwa liwopwa kila upandi na watovangondo wakigholoka kumilyangu. Ila patufughula mlyango tumlolili ng'ogha mundu yoyose mghati!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mkulu wa wagholokela wa Lighuta lya Sapanga na watambika wakulu pawayoghanila habali hai walikangasili nesu, wakakonyana vila itewela badili gha kuhyoghanila mghalu hula. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akahika mundu mmonga, akawalongela, “Wala wandu muwavikili muuwopwa, hinaa wavile kulighuta lya Sapanga, wanguwavula wandu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Hinu, mkulu wa wagholokela wa Lighuta lya Sapanga pamonga na wandu ghaki wakayenda ku Lighuta lya Sapanga, wakawayegha. Ila watumila ng'ogha makakala kuwakamula, kwaikiva wawelili na holu yiwa wandu watewatova maganga.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Hinu, wakawayegha wandumindumi wala, wakawagholokesa kuulongolo gha njengakaya. Mtambika mkulu akawakonya, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tuwakanisili lipalalipala kukotoho kuvula kwa lihina lya Yesu, hinaa Myalandalili mavulo gha mwenga ku Yelusalemu hyogha na kangi mngupala twenga tuwoneki yiwa tumkoma mundu hayu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petelo, akiva pamonga na wala wandumindumi ghangi, akayanga, “Tungupalwa tumyitikili Sapanga na ng'ogha wandu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Sapanga wa mbuyi wa twenga amhindulili Yesu kuhuma kukihu kwa mwenga kumkoma kwa kumvamba kumpingika. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Sapanga amyinulili alongosi pamonga ma mweni, akiva Kilisito na mlokola, ili awawesesi wandu wa Izilaili waleki mahakata, wapokeli kulekeselwa mahakata ghao. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Twenga tulola kwa mihu gha twenga mighalu hai, pamonga na Mpumulo wa Sapanga avile Sapanga anguwapegha wogha wamyitikila.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wajumbi wa hila njengakaya ngulu pawayoghanila milandu hai, wahyomili nesu, hata kupala kuwakoma wandumindumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ila Mfalisayo mmonga akemilwi Gamalieli awelili mvula wa laghililo na atundamililwi nesu na wandu wogha, akagholoka kuulongolo gha lila njengakaya, akalaghila wala wandumindumi wahumiswi panji kwa lipindi mayaghani. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Hinu, akawalongela wala wajumbi wa njengakaya, “Mwenga Waizilaeli wayangu, mliwachili kwa yala mngupala kuwagholela wandu hagha. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Dahile mayaghani, kuhumilili mundu mmonga lihina lyake Teuda, akajilongela yiwa mundu mkola mlima na wandu pabehi imia njechi wakamyitikila. Ila akomilwi, hinu wavulwa ghaki wogha wakapalaghanyika na lihengu lyaki likayomokela baha. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kangi, kuulongolo, lipindi lila lya kuvalanga wandu, akahumila Yudasi wa Galilaya. Hayu na mweni alilongosa wandu, ila na mweni kangi akomilwi, na wavulwa ghaki wakapalaghanyika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Hinaa kangi ninguwalongela, mkotoho kuwaghola wandu hagha kindu chochosi, muwaleki wayendi! Kwaikiva, ikiva mghalu hau au lihengu lyao hali litumbulilwi na mundu, liteyalamila lyeni. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ila ikiva itumbulilwi na Sapanga, mtewesa ng'ogha kuwasinda, ila mtelilola mngutovana na Sapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Hinu, wandu wogha wa njengakaya wakayitikilana na Gamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nagha wakawakema wala wandumindumi, wakalaghila watovwe hiyatu na kuwakanila wakotoho kuvula kangi kwa lihina lya Yesu, hinu wakawaleka wayendi. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Hinu, wandumindumi wakahuka panji gha hila njengakaya wakiva na luheku nesu, kwaikiva Sapanga awavalangilili yiwa wavile na utundamilu kwa weni kupughanywa kwaikiva gha lihina lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Waleka ng'ogha kuvula na kutangasa Habali Maha gha Yesu yiwa ni Kilisito. Wakayendelela kuvula na kutangasa machuwa hyogha ku Lighuta lya Sapanga na mumaghuta gha wandu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Watangili isaba wa wandumindumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Kumachuwa ghala, kuwakwinila wala kuwelili na Wayahudi wailongile kwa kigiliki weni pawayongeseka, kukahumila mang'ung'uliko paghati gha wavulwa walongelili Kigiliki na wala walongelili Kiebulania. Wala wawelili wakilongela Kigiliki wang'ung'ulikili yiwa wadala wa wala wahovitiliwi na walumi ghao wawelili wakiwaisemwa kupeghwa hindu gha kila lelo. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Hinu, wandumindumi ikumi na ivili wawakemili lipinga lyogha lya wala wavulwa wa Yesu, wakalonga, “Maha ng'ogha twenga kuleka kulilongelela lilando lya Sapanga ili tughole lihengu kupeghana mulyo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Hinu, walongu wa twenga, mhaghuli paghati mwa mwenga wandu isaba wavile wamaha wangulongoswa na Mpumulo Mbuletenesu na wavile na luhala, na twenga tutewapegha lihengu hali lya kupegha mulyo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Ila twenga, tuteghola kuyupa na lihengu lya kutangasa lilando lya Sapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Mghalu hula upalilwi na lipinga lyogha lya wakwinila. Wakawahaghula Sitefano, mundu wa kukola lilando lya Sapanga nesu na avile na kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, Filipu, Pilokolo na Nikasoli na Timona na Palimena na Nikolao wa Anitiokia akiva awelili kakonganika na dini gha Kiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Wakawavika kuulongolo gha wandumindumi, na weni wakawayupila na kuwavikila mawoku.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Hinu lilando lya Sapanga liyendelelili kuyongeseka na wakwinila kula Yelusalemu wakayongeseka nesu na lipinga likulunga lya watambika wakayitikila.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano angukamulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Sapanga amhighilili nesu Sitefano, akampegha makakala ngoo na mweni akaghola vilangihi na kukangasa paghati mwa wandu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ila wamonga wa wandu wawelili wa Lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi likemilwi, “Lighuta lya kukonganika wayahudi lya wandu wavile pekesu” wasindanili kwa milandu na Sitefano na weni wahumili ku Kulene na ku Alekisandilia; wamonga wahumili ku Kilikia na ku Asia. Wandu hagha wakatumbula kusindana na Sitefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ila wawesili ng'ogha kumsinda kwaikiva gha luhala ghaki na kwaikiva gha yula Mpumulo amlongosili lipindi paalongelili. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Hinu, wakawapegha swinda wandu wamonga ili walonge, “Tumyoghanilili Sitefano akimlighu Musa na Sapanga kwa milandu ghaki.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Hinu, wakawasongesela wandu na wagogolo na wavula wa laghililo. Na weni wakamhikila Sitefano, wakamkamula na kumyegha kuulongolo gha njengakaya ngulu gha Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wakawayegha wandu munjengakaya wa kumlongelela uhwangi wavile wakilonga, “Mundu hayu, kaleka ng'ogha kulonga milandu gha malighu mlighuta hali baha kumbuletenesu pamonga na laghililo lya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwaikiva tumyoghanilili kala akilonga yiwa hayu Yesu wa Nazaleti ateyalamisa nesu lighuta hali na kupyatilila kutali mighalu gha dahile ghala hyogha tupokelili kuhuma kwa Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wogha wawelili munjengakaya wakamtumbulilila mihu Sitefano, wakaulola wuso ghaki uvile handa Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Sitefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Hinu, Mtambika Mkulu akamkonya Sitefano, “Ghuli, mighalu hai ni chakaka?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Na mweni Sitefano akayanga, “Walongu wa nenga na watati, mnihyoghanili! Ukulu wa Sapanga umuhumililili mbuyi wa twenga Ibulahimu paawelili kula Mesopotamia kambila kayenda ng'ogha kutama kula Halani.” <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Sapanga amlongelelili, “Uhuki kumlima ghako, uhuki kuukolu wa wenga, uyendi kumlima hula nitekulangiha.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Hinu Ibulahimu akahuka kumlima gha Wakalidayo akayenda kutama Halani. Badili gha kihu kya tati ghaki, Sapanga akamuhumisa kangi Halani na kumyegha kulikala kumlima hau mngulikala hinaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Sapanga kampegha ng'ogha hata mahala pamonga paweli ulihi ghaki hata utali wa lighulu limonga, ila, amlaghilili kumpegha mlima hau uvile mlima ghaki na gha wawelekwa ghaki, Lipindi lila, awelili ng'ogha na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Sapanga amlongelelilili havi, “Wawelekwa ghako wateyeghwa kumlima ghao ng'ogha, na kula wategholwa wahusutu na watehakilwa kwa machuva imia njechi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ila nenga nitewatova wandu wa mlima hula utewaghola mwenga wahusutu. Hinu nitewahuyisa kumlima hau ili wahiki kuniyupa mahala baha.ʼ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Hinu Sapanga akaghola lilaghano na Ibulahimu lilaghano lya lijandu hinu Ibulahimu akamlela Isaka na kumuyingisa jandu lichuwa lya inane badili gha kuwelekwa kwaki kuulongolo Isaka akamlela Yakobu na mweni Yakobu akawalela wala wagogolo wa twenga ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Wala mambuyi wamwonelili wifu Yusufu, wakamuusa handa mhusutu ku Misili. Ila Sapanga awelili pamonga na mweni,” <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akamkombola kumahakili ghaki hyogha. Sapanga akampegha luhala na kumhighila kuulongolo gha Falao, nkosi wa Misili, hata Falao akamvika aweli mkulu wa hula mlima na lighuta lya kinkosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Hinu kuulongolo, kukahumila njala ngulu kumahala kogha ku Misili na Kanani, ikaghola lung'ai lukulu. Mulyo ukawayomokela wambuyi wa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Hinu, Yakobu paaliyoghanila habali yiwa kula mlima gha Misili kuwelili na mulyo, akawayegha wana ghaki, hagha ndiwa mbuyi wa twenga, wayendi kula Misili kwa lihanja lya mtumbulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ku mwanja ghao gha ivili, Yusufu akajilangiha kwa walongo ghaki, na Nkosi Falao wa Misili akawamanya walongo wa Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yusufu akayegha ujumbi kwa tati ghaki wamkema Yakobu awayeghi walongo ghaki wogha, wogha wawelili wandu isabani na itano, wayendili ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Nagha, Yakobu ayendili ku Misili, kula mweni na mbuyi wa twenga ghangi wahovili haku. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mindumbi ghao ikahuyiswa mbaka Shekemu, ikasikwa kulimambi lila livile Ibulahimu awelili kalihemela kwa mapesa kuhuma kwa wana wa Hamoli.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Lipindi palihika pabehi kutimila kwa lila lilaghano Sapanga ampeghili Ibulahimu, wandu wa twenga walelilanili na kuyongeseka nesu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ndiwa, Nkosi mmonga kammanya ng'ogha Yusufu alitumbula kulongosa kula Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Nkosi hayu awagholelili uhakata wandu wa twenga, kwa kuwaghola mahakata na kuwalongela watati wa twenga wawaviki wana wanung'una panji ili wahovi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Kulipindi hali Musa na mweni awelekilwi. Awelili mwana maheli nesu. Alelelilwi mulighuta kwa miehi itatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Badili gha kusindwa kumhigha wakamtagha panji, biti nkosi wa Misili akamtola na akamlela handa mwana ghaki mweni baha. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa akavulwa mighalu hyogha gha luhala gha Wamisili, akawela na uweso nesu kumilandu na matendu ghaki.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Paawelili na machuva ialobaini akakolwa na luhujulu ayendi kuwalola walongo ghaki Waizilaili. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kula akamlola Mmisili mmonga akimghola mmonga wa wala walongo ghaki uhakata, akayenda kumkombola, na kwa kuhuyisila mghalu, akamkoma yula Mmisili. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa aliwachilili yiwa walongu ghaki watemanya yiwa Sapanga angumtumila kkuwalokola kupitila mweni, ila wamanyili ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Lichuwa lya ivili ghaki, awalolili Waizilaili waivili wakitovana, akayenda kuwalekanisa ili wakotoho kutovana akilonga, ‘Mwenga ni walongu, kwa kyani hinu, kugholana uhakata mwenga kwa mwenga?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Yula awelili angumtova myaki akamkukula Musa mmbali akilonga, ‘Ni ghani kakuvika wenga uvile mkulu na mwamula wa twenga?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />‘Ghuli, ungupala kunikoma handa umkomili yula Mmisili lichu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Badili gha kuhyoghanila ghala, Musa akabhutuka mbilo, akayenda kutama kumlima gha Midiani na kula akalela wana waivili.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Badili gha machuva ialobaini, Mtumikila wa Bambu wa kundumba amhumilili Musa kukiputila kiwelili kinguyaka lyoto kula mulivagha pabehi na litumbi Sinai.” <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa alikangasili nesu kulola mghalu hau hata akayenda pabehi ili ashungulile, ila ahyoghanilili lilowi gha Bambu likilonga. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Nenga ni Sapanga wa mbuyi zyako, Sapanga wa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu. Musa akahihimila kwa holu hinu kayendelela ng'ogha kulola nesu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Bambu akamlongela, “Uwopoli makubasi ghako kwaikiva baha ugholoka ni mahala kwa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />“Niyalolili mahakata wangugholwa wandu wa nenga kula Misili. Nihyoghanilili kililo kyao, na nenga nihuluka ili kuwakombola. Hinu hinaa, nitekulaghila Misili.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Hayu Musa ndiwa yulayula wandu wa Izilaili wamkanilili pawalongelili, 'Ni ghani akuvikili wenga uvile mkulu na mlamula wa twenga?ʼ Pala kwa njila gha yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga amhumilili kukiputila kiwelili kinguyaka lyoto, Sapanga kamyegha hayu aweli mkulu na mkombola.” <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ndiwa awalongosili Waizilaili wahuki Misili kwa kughola vilangihi na mighalu gha kukangasa kumlima wa Misili, kubahali gha Shamu na kwa machuva ialobaini mulivagha. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa ndiwa awalongili wandu wa Izilaili, “Bambu Sapanga wa mwenga atewayinulila mlota handa nenga na atevile mmonga paghati gha mwenga walongu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Musa awelili pamonga na wambuyi wa twenga kulivagha ndiwa ailongile na mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kulitumbi Sinai. Na ndiwa apeghilwi hila milandu gha ukomu atupeghi twenga.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Hata nagha mambuyi wa twenga walemili kumyoghanila, wakamkanila na wakapala kuhuya Misili.” <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamlongelili Haluni, “Tugholeli milungu itetulongosa munjila, kwaikiva tumanya ng'ogha yampatili hayu Musa atulongosili kuhuma ku Misili.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Pala ndiwa pawajigholile kindu kya kuhonga mlandano wa ndama, wakaitambikila na kuigholela mhambu kindu wakigholili kwa mawoku ghao weni baha. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ila Sapanga ahukili paghati gha weni, akawaleka wayupi ndondwa zya kunani, handa iyandikililwi kuhitabu kya walota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">“mwenga wandu wa Izilaeli! Nenga ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">mnipeghili matambiku gha wakokolo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kwa machuva ialobaini kula kulivagha!”<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />“Mwenga mpapili kibimilo kya mlungu Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na ndondwa gha kuhongwa gha mlungu wa mwenga Lefani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Vindu vya kuhongwa ili mvitundamilili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Kwaikiva gha nagha nitewayegha mvile wahusutu kutali kupiti Babeli.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Kula mulivagha mambuyi wa twenga wawelili na lila libimilo lya kulangiha yiwa Sapanga ka pala. Ligholilwi handa Sapanga amlongelili Musa aligholi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Watati wa twenga pawayomola kupokela kibimilo kwa kupeghana mbaka lipindi lya ulongosi wa Yoshua, na wakilongoswa na Yoshua wayendili kutola mlima kuhuma kwa ghala milima yavile Sapanga awawingili wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi kuulongolo gha weni na lyeni likatama kumlima mbaka lipindi lya Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi ambendezili Sapanga, na mweni Daudi akamluwa Sapanga ampeghi uweso wa kumchengela lighuta Sapanga wa Yakobu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ila Selemani ndiwa amchengilili Sapanga lighuta.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Hata nagha, Sapanga avile kunani nesu kalikala ng'ogha kulighuta lichengilwi na wandu, handa mlota ghaki angulongela.” <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Bambu alonga, kundumba ni kikalilo kya ukulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na mlima wogha ni kikalilo kya nenga kya kuvika maghulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Mtenichengela lighuta lya ghuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Na mahala ghani nitepumulila?”<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ghuli ng'ogha nenga mweni baha nigholili vindu havi vyogha?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Sitefano akayendela kulonga, “Mwenga watatala wakulu! Mioyu gha mwenga ni ikamala na mapulukilo gha mwenga majoghu handa wandu wammanyili ng'ogha Sapanga. Mwenga ni handa wambuyi wa mwenga. Machuwa hyogha mngumkingama Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ghuli, kuvile na mlota yoyose wambuyi wa mwenga wamhakili ng'ogha? Wawakomili wala wandu Sapanga awayeghili, watangasili kuhika kwa mundu yula mweni ulungwana. Na hinaa, mwenga mkamhyuka na mkamkoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwenga ndiwa mpokela laghililo lya Sapanga kwa kupitila watumikila wa kundumba, ila muyitikila ng'ogha.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano angukomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wala wagogolo wa njengakaya pawayoghanilili hagha, wahyomili nesu, wakamkekenelela. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ila Sitefano kunu akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, akalola kunani kundumba, akaulola ukwilikihi wa Sapanga na Yesu kapegwa utundamilo mkulu kupiti wogha. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akalonga, “Mlole! Ningulola kundumba kugubutulwa na Mwana wa Mundu kapeghwa utundamilu mkulunga kupiti wogha.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Hinu wandu wogha mula munjengakaya wakakanila kumyoghanila wakadiwa mapulikilo kunu wakitova lilowi na wakamyendela Sitefano wogha kwa pamonga. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Wakamhumisa panji gha mmbwani, wakamtova maganga. Wala wandu walolile kwa mihu na kuwesa kumlongelela wakavika makoti gha weni pahi gha ugholokela wa mhongolo mmonga lihina lyake Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Pawawelili wakiyendelela kumtova Sitefano kwa maganga mweni akiva anguyupa, “Bambu Yesu, upokeli mpumulo gha nenga!” <figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Mundu angukomwa kwa kutovwa na maganga</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Akatundamila manughuna, akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, “Bambu, ukotoho kuwavalangila mahakata hagha.” Pakayomola kulonga hagha akahova.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Na mweni Sauli awelili pala akilola yiwa sitefano angupalwa kuhova.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli angulihakili lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Machuwa ghalaghala lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito liwelili ku Yelusalemu litumbulili kupokela mahakili makulunga. Wakwinila wogha wakapalaghanyika ku Yudasia na Samalia, wahighalile ni wandumindumi hela. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wandu wamtundamila Sapanga wakamsika Sitefano na kumgholela malumbililo makulunga.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ila Sauli ayendelelili kuyalamisa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito, ayingilili lighuta kwa lighuta, na kuwakamula wavulwa, walumi na wadala, na kuyenda kuwavika muuwopwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habali maha ingutangaswa ku Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Kwa nagha wala wapalaghanyikili, wayendelili wakitangasa hula ujumbi kila mahala kula wayendili. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Na mweni Filipo ayingilili kummbwani wa Samalia na kutangasila wandu Habali Maha zya Kilisito kwa wenikaya wa kula. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Wandu pawayoghanila kwa umaha hula ujumbi wa Filipo na kulola hila mighalu gha kukangasa aigholili wandu wakamyoghanila nesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mahoka wawelili mghati mwa wandu watangala wakawahuka wakitova lilowi likulunga, na kangi wandu watangala wawelili vikongonu vipola na wawelili walemafu walamisilwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Wandu wa mmbwani hula wakahekelela.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Na kuwelili na mundu mmonga akemilwi Simoni awelili akilikala mmbwani hula kuhuma dahile. Mweni awelili akighola mighalu gha uhawi na kuwakangasa wandu wa Samalia. Ajigholili yiwa ni mundu mkola mlima. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Wandu wogha, wasokombi kwa wakulungwa, wamyoghanilili kwa maha wakilonga, “Simoni ndiwa makakala gha kisapanga ikemilwi Ikakala ngulu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wandu wawelili wakimyoghanila nesu mweni kwa vila awelili kawakangasa kwa uhawi ghaki kwa lipindi litali. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ila wandu pawakwinila Habali Maha gha unkosi wa Sapanga na Habali gha Yesu Kilisito awatangasili Filipo, wogha wabatisilwi, walumi kwa wadala. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Na mweni Simoni akwinilili, na badili gha kubatiswa awelili akikovekelana na Filipo, akakangaswa na mighalu gha kukangasa na vilangihi viwelili vingugholeka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wala wandumindumi wawelili Yelusalemu pawayoghanilili yiwa wenikaya wa Samalia wakwinilili lilando lya Sapanga, wakawayegha Petelo na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Pawahikili wakawayupila wala wawelili wakwinila ili wapokeli Mpumulo wa Sapanga; <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kwaikiva Mpumulo wa Sapanga awelili ng'ogha kamghulukila hata mmonga ghao, wawelili wabatisililwi kwa lihina lya Bambu Yesu hela. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Hinu, Petelo na Yohanawakavika mawoko kunani ghao na kuwayupila wala wakwinila, na weni wakapokela Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Kwa nagha Simoni paalolili yiwa wakwinila wapokelili Mpumulo wa Sapanga kwa kupitila kuvikilwa mawoko gha wandumindumi, Nagha akapala kuwapegha Petelo na Yohanamapesa akilonga, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Mnipeghi na nenga uweso hau ili yoyose nitemvikila mawoku kunani ghaki, apokeli Mpumulo wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ila Petelo akamyanga, “Mapesa gha wenga yayaghamilile kutali pamonga na wenga mweni, kwaikiva unguwachila yiwa unguwesa kuhemela uweso wa Sapanga kwa kupitila mapesa. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Wenga uvile ng'ogha pamonga na twenga kulihengu hali kwa ikiva mpumulo ghako ni mhakata kumihu gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kwa nagha, uleki uhakata ghako na umkovekeli Sapanga na umyupi Bambu na mweni mani atewesa kukulekesela mawachilo yavile mu moyu ghako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Nenga ningulola wenga yiwa umemeswa wifu mkalipa na mahakata ghako yangukukola!”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Hinu Simoni akawalongela Petelo na Yohana, “Mniyupile mwenga kwa Bambu, ili ghala muyalongelili yakotoho nihikila.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Pawayomola kuwalongela wandu vila wammanya Yesu na kutangasa lilando lya Bambu, Petelo na Yohanawakahuya Yelusalemu wakitangasa Habali Maha kuvimbwani vitangala vya Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo angumbatisa mkulu wa mlima wa Esiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Lichuwa limonga mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga amlongelili Filipo, “Ujiyandali uyendi kusini kupitila njila ihumilili Yelusalemu kuyenda Gaza njila hila inguyendela mulivagha.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Hinu, Filipo akajiyandala, akatumbula mwanja. Lipindi lilalila kuwelili na mwesiopia mmonga, mundu avile mbendi, akiva anguyenda ukaya. Hayu mundu awelili mkola mlima mvika hindu wa Kandake kwa nkosi mdala wa Esiopia. Na mweni awelili kayenda Yelusalemu kuyupa na lipindi hali awelili anguhuya akiva kakwela mbutuka ikweghwa na likokolo. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Paawelili anguyenda, awelili angujisomela hitabu kya mlota wa Sapanga Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Hinu, Mpumulo wa Sapanga akamlongela Filipo, “Uyendi, usoheleli pabehi na mbutuka hila.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo akabhutuka mbilo kusohelela hila mbutuka, akamhyoghanila hayu mundu angusoma kihitabu kya mlota wa Sapanga Isaya. Filipo akamkonya, “Ghuli, ungumanya hagha unguyasoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yula mundu mvika hindu akamyanga, “Ghuli niwesa kumanya ikiva kwahela mundu wa kunighalambulila?” Kangi akamlongela Filipo ahiki kunani gha mbutuka, atami pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Hinu, mahala gha mayandiko mambuletenesu awelili angusoma pawelili nagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Awelili handa kondolu anguyeghwa kuhinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">nuu handa mwanakondolu anguputulilwa mipuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">kawesa ng'ogha kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Apughanisilwi na wampegha ng'ogha utundamilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwa hela mundu atewesa kulongela kukiwelekwa kyaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwaikiva kulama kwa mweni kuhumiswa mumlimawogha.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Hayu mbendi akamlongela Filipo, “Nilongeli, hayu mlota wa Sapanga angulongela habali liki? Angulonga mighalu ghaki mweni au gha mundu ghangi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Hinu, Filipo akatumbula kutumila mahala pala pamayandiko Mambuletenesu, akamlongela Habali Maha gha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Pawawelili wanguyendelela na mwanja, wahikili mahala pavile na masi, na hayu mkulu akalonga, “Mahala baha pavile na masi, ni hindu liki kinikanili nikotoho batiswa?” <figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8:36">Mundu angubatiswa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo akalonga, “Ikiva utemkwinila Yesu Kilisito kwa moyu ghako wogha utebatiswa.” Na mweni akayanga, “Hina, ningukwinila yiwa Yesu Kilisito ni Mwana wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Hinu, hayu mkulu akalaghila hila mbutuka ligholoki, na wogha waivili, Filipo na hayu mundu wakaghuluka mmasi, na mweni Filipo akambatisa. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Pawahuka kuhuma mmasi, bwitu Mpumulo wa Bambu akamtola Filipo. Na hayu mundu avile mbendi kamlola ng'ogha kangi, ila akayendelela na mwanja akiva na luheku. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo kajilola kabwitukila ku mlima waukema Azoto, akaphita ku mimbwani hyogha akitangasa Habali Maha gha Yesu mbaka paahikili ku Kaisalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli angumkwinila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Lipindi lila Sauli ayendilelili kuwaghola wandu wamtili wala wandu wakwinila wa Bambu kwa kuwalongela yiwa atewakoma. Ayendili kwa mtambika Mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akaluwa wampeghi lihamba gha kumtambula kumaghuta gha kuyupila Wayahudi kula Damesiki, ili pakawalola kula walumi au wadala wamkwinilia Yesu, awakamuli na kuwayegha ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ila paawelili munjila pabehi kuhika Damesiki, bwitu mhana kuhuma kunani umlangasilili kogha na kogha. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Akaguwa pahi na kuhyoghanila lilowi likilonga, “Sauli, Sauli! Kwa kyani ungunihakili?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Na mweni Sauli akamkonya, “Ni ghani wenga Bambu?” Na mweni akayanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Nenga ni Yesu yula ungunihakili.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Hinaa uleki kila ukighola ugholoki uyendi, uyingili mummbwani na haku utelongelwa mghalu ungupalwa kughola.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wala wandu wawelili na Sauli pamonga kumwanja wagholokili pala, wakiva wavile ng'ogha na lya kulonga, wakayoghanila lila lilowi ila wamwonili ng'ogha mundu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli akayinuka, na paahumbulili mihu ghaki kawesa ng'ogha kulola hindu chochosi, hinu wala wandu wakamlongosa kwa kumkola liwoku mbaka mumbwani Damesiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli alikalili machuwa itatu ng'ogha kulola, na lipindi lila kalyegha ng'ogha hata kunywegha ng'ogha chochosi.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Hinu, kula Damesiki kuwelili na mvulwa mmonga akemilwi Anania. Bambu amlongelili kumawonu, “Anania!” Anania akayitikila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">“Hina Bambu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Na mweni Bambu akamlongela, “Jiyandali uyendi kunjila waikema njila ihyeta ng'ogha, kulighuta lya Yudasi ukamkonye mundu wa mbwani Taso wamkema Sauli. Hinaa anguyupa, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />na kumawonu Sauli alolili mundu wamkema Anania akiyingila mughati na kumvikila mawoku ili awesi kulola kangi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ila Anania akayanga, “Bambu, ninguhyoghanila habali zya mundu hayu kuhuma kwa wandu watangala, wakilonga mahakata awagholili wandu ghako kula Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />na kahika baha akiva na laghililo kuhuma kwa watambika wakulu ili apati kuwawopa wogha wala wayupa kwa lihina lya wenga.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ila Bambu akamlongela, “Uyendi hela, kwaikiva nimhaghulili mundu hayu aweli mtumikila ghangu, ili atangasi lihina lya nenga kwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha na kwa wankosi na kwa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nenga mweni baha nitemlangiha vila angupalwa kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha lihina lya nenga.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Hinu, Anania akayenda, akayingila kulighuta lila. akavika mawoku ghaki kunani gha Sauli, akalonga, “Mlongu Sauli, Bambu yesu akuhumilili ukiva munjila kuhika baha, aniyeghili ili upati kulola kangi na kulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Na palapala vindu handa mipatu gha homba viguwili kuhuma mumihu gha Sauli, akawesa kulola kangi. Akagholoka na akabatiswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Na pakayomola kulyegha mulyo, makakala ghaki yakamhuyila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli angutangasa Habali Maha kula Damesiki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli alikalili machuwa mayaghani pamonga na wavulwa kula Damesiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Bahala atumbulili kulongela milandu gha Sapanga kumalighuta gha kutundamilila Wayahudi yiwa Yesu Kilisito ni Mwana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wandu wogha wamyoghanilili walikangasili, wakalonga, “Ghuli, mundu hayu ng'ogha yulayula awakomili wala wawelili wamkwinila Yesu kula Yelusalemu? Ghuli kahika ng'ogha baha akiva na lukani lwa kuwakamula wandu wala na kuwayegha kwa watambika wakulu?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ila Sauli akayendelela kutangasa Habali Maha kwa uweso, na akahighilisa yiwa Yesu ndiwa Kilisito kwa Wayahudi watamili Damesiki.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Badili gha machuwa yatangala kuyenda, Wayahudi wakonganilili na kuhakula njila gha kumkoma Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ila Sauli akapokela habali gha mghalu hau. Uhiku na Pamuhi wagholokili kumilyango gha kuyingila mmbwani ili wawese kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ila lipindi lya uhiku wavulwa ghaki wakamtola, wakamhulusa pahi mghati gha libeja likulungwa kwa kupitila kulililanga liwelili kulikuta lya mmbwani.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli anguhuya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli paahikili ku Yelusalemu ayesili kukongine na weni. Ila wogha wamtilili na wawesa ng'ogha kumyitikila yiwa mweni awelili mkwinila wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Pala, Balinaba akahika akamtola Sauli, akamyegha kwa wandumindumi na kuwalongela vila Sauli amlolili Bambu munjila na vila Bambu alongelili na mweni. Hilahila akawalongela vila Sauli awelili angutangasa Habali Maha akiva na holu ng'ogha kula Damesiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Hinu, Sauli atamili pamonga na weni, akatyanga Yelusalemu hyogha akitangasa lilando lya Bambu kwa kugangamala. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kangi akasindana na Wayahudi wala walongela Kigiliki, ila weni wakapala kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Wala walongu wakwinila Yesu pawamanyili mghalu hula, wakamtola Sauli, wakamyegha Kaisalia, wakamleka ayendi kummbwani Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Lipindi lila lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito watamili ng'ogha na holu kogha ku Yudasia, na Galilaya na Samalia. Wayendelelili kukula kiupumulo na kumtundamila Bambu na lipinga lya likayongeseka kwa mtanga wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angumlamisa Ainea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Lichuwa limonga Petelo awatyangililili wandu wa Sapanga walikalili kula mmbwani Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kula amlolili mundu mmonga akemilwi Ainea yula avile kwa machuva inane awelili awonjili mukindanda kwaikiva awelili vikongonu ghaki vipola. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Hinu, Petelo akamlongela, “Ainea, Yesu Kilisito kakulamisa. Uyimuki utoli lihinda lyako.” bwitu Ainea akayimuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wenikaya wogha wa mmbwani Lida na ku bondi lya Shaloni pawamlolili Ainea akityanga, wogha wakamkwinila Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kuwelili na mkwinila mmonga mdala mumbwani Yopa wamkema Tabita kwa kigiliki ni Dolikasi ingumaanisa sheshe. Hayu mdala awelili akighola mighalu maha yatangala na kuwatanga wavile na hindu ng'ogha machuwa hyogha. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ku machuwa ghala awelili angulwala na akahova. Pawayomolili kughulula higha ghaki, wakamuwonjesa mghati gha kyumba kya kunani. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yopa kutali ng'ogha na Luda kwa nagha wavulwa pawayoghanilili yiwa Petelo awelili Luda, wakawayegha wandu waivili kwa mweni na wakamluwa, “Uhiki kwa twenga hinaa.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Hinu, Petelo akayenda pamonga na weni. Na mweni paahikili wakamyegha mghati gha kyumba kya kunani. Haku kuwelili na wadala wahovitiliwi na walumi ghao wamtindililili Petelo, wakilila na kumlangiha lihabiti na nguu zyogha Dolikasi awasonelili paawelili mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petelo akawalaghila wandu wogha wayendi panji, akatundamila manung'una, akayupa, hinu akaulola hula higha, akalonga, “Tabita, uyinuki.” Na mweni Tabita akafumbula mihu ghaki, paamlolili Petelo akatama. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petelo akamkamula liwoko akamyinula, hinu akawakema wala wamkwinila Yesu na wala wahoviliwi na walumi ghao, akawapegha kumawoku ghao akiva mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Habali hazi zilandalili kogha mbandi zya Yopa na wandu watangala wakamkwinila Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petelo akalikala Yopa kwa machuwa ngenju akiva kwa Simoni mghola hindu gha ngosi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petelo angukongana na Kolinelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Haku kaisalia, kuwelili na mundu mmonga lihina lyaki Kolinelio. Mweni awelili mkulu wa lipinga lya watovangondo wa kilumi walikema “Lipinga lya Italia.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Awelili mundu wa maha, na mweni pamonga na walongo ghaki wogha wamtundamila Sapanga, awelili angughola vindu vitangala kuwatanga wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha na awelili angumtundamila Sapanga machuwa yayendelela. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />lichuwa limonga saa itisa pamuhi, alolili mawonu lipala lipala mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akiyingila mghati na kumlongela, “Kolinelio!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolinelio akamtumbulilila mihu hayu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kwa holu, akamkonya, “Bambu, kuvile na kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Yula Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamyanga, “Sapanga kayoghanila mayupo ghako na mapegho ghako kwa wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha hinu kakukumbwike. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Hinu, uwayeghi wandu Yopa wayendi kumkema mundu mmonga lihina lyaki Simoni hilahila wangumkema Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Mweni angulikala ukaya kwa Simoni mghola hindu gha ngosi yula lighuta lyaki lipabehi na bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga awelili akilongela na mweni paahuka Kolinelio akawakema watumikila ghaki waivili wa ukaya, na mtovangondo mmonga awelili akimtundamila Sapanga na avile amonga gha wala wamtumikilili. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Akawalongela hyogha yahumilili, hinu akawalaghila wayendi kummbwani Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Kilau ghaki iwelili handa saa sita pamuhi, wala wandu waitatu wakiva wambila na mwanja, ila wakiva pabehi na kuhika kumbwani Yopa, Petelo akakwela kunani gha lighuta kuyupa. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Njala ikamkola, akapala kulyegha mulyo. Ila lipindi wakiteleka mulyo akawonja lughono litopehu akahikilwa na mawonu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Akalola kundumba kugubutuka na hindu handa nguu ngulu inguhuluswa pahi ikiva ikamulilwi pandi zyogha njechi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mghati gha nguu hila kuwelili na kila mikokolo: mikokolo wavile na maghulu njechi na mikokolo wakukuluhuka na wambongu wa kunani. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Hinu akahyoghanila lilowi likimlongela, “Petelo, uyinuki uhinji, ulyeghi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ila Petelo akayanga, “Ng'ogha Bambu, nenga kuhuma dahile nilyegha ng'ogha hata chochosi wakivalangila yiwa kya maha ng'ogha kulyeghwa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Lila lilowi likahyoghanika kangi likimlongela, “Ukotoho kuvikema vya maha ng'ogha kulyeghwa vindu vila Sapanga kalonga yiwa vya maha kulyeghwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Mghalu hau uhumilili miyanja itatu, kuulongolo hila nguu ikahuyiswa kunani kundumba.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petelo paawelili akiyendelela kulikangasa na kuikonya haki liki kwa ghala mawonu, wala wandu wayeghilwi na Kolinelio wakalilola lighuta lya Simoni mghola hindu gha ngosi hinu wakagholoka kumlyangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Wakakema wakakonya wakalonga, “Ghuli baha, kuvile na mhenja mghati hamu yula wangumkema Simoni au lihina ghangi Petelo?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petelo paawelili akiyendelela kuliwachila amanyi kyani haki kwa yala mawonu, bahala Mpumulo wa Sapanga akamlongela, “Uyoghanili pavile na wandu waitatu baha, wangukuhakula. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Hinu, ugholoki na uhuluki kuhuma kunani gha mlighuta uyendi pamonga na wala ukotoho kuvile na holu kwaikiva nenga niwalaghila.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Hinu Petelo akahuluka pahi na kuwalongela wala wandu, “Nenga ndiwa mngunihakula. Kwa kyani mhika?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Weni wakamyanga, “Mkulu wa lipinga lya watovangondo imia wamkema Kolinelio katuyegha na mweni ni mundu wamaha, myupa Sapanga na kutundamilwa kuulongolo gha Wayahudi wogha, Alongililwi na mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga uyendi ukaya kwa mweni ili kuhyoghanila milandu ghako.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petelo akawapokela mghati, akawapegha mahala pakuwonja uhiku hula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Kilau ghaki, Petelo akatumbula mwanja pamonga naweni, na amonga gha wakwinila ghangi wa kula Yopa wakonganili namweni. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Lichuwa lya ivili wahikili ku Kaisalia na kula Kolinelio awelili anguwalindila pamonga na walongo na waghanja awelili kawakema wahiki. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petelo paawelili anguyingila, Kolinelio akahuma panji kumlola, akaguwa kifulifuli. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ila Petelo akamyinula, akamlongela, “Gholoka, kwaikiva hata nenga ni mundu hela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petelo ayendelelili kulongela na Kolinelio akiva anguyingila mulighuta akalola wandu watangala walikungula. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Akawalongela, “Mwenga mngumanya lipala yiwa Myahudi yeyose kakaniswa na laghililo ghaki gha dini kukongana na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha ila Sapanga kanilongela yiwa nikotoho kumuwachila mundu yeyosi yiwa kalemwa na Sapanga au wamaha ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, pamnikema nikahika kwa kulema ng'ogha. Hinu ninguwakonya kwa kyani mnikema.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolinelio akalonga, “Ni handa machuwa njechi yapiti lisaa handa hali, lisaa itisa pamuhi, niwelili nikiyupa kukyumba. Bwitu, mundu awelili amevala nguu mbulete pee akagholoka kuulongolo gha nenga, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />namweni akanilongela, ‘Kolinelio! Sapanga kayoghanila mayupo ghako na kakukumbwike kwa kutanga wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Hinu umlaghili mundu ayendi kumbwani Yopa akamkemi mundu mmonga wamkema Simoni, kwa lihina ghangi Petelo, kalikala mulighuta gha Simoni mundu wa kughola hindu gha ngosi angulikala pabehi na bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Na palapala nikayegha wandu kwa wenga, na wenga ughola maheli kuhika. Hinaa twenga wogha twakuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa kuhyoghanila mighalu hyogha Bambu akulaghilili utulongeli.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo anguwatangasila wandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Baha Petelo akatumbula kulonga, “Hinaa nimanya yiwa chakaka Sapanga kahela ubaghulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ila Sapanga angumpokela mundu yoyosi yula angughola yala ghamaha. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mwenga mngumanya yiwa Sapanga alaghilili wandu ghaki kuwatangasila Waizilaeli Habali Maha, yiwa wapati kuponga kuhuma kwa mweni kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito yula avile ni Bambu wa wogha. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mwenga mngumanya mghalu uhumilili ku Yudasia hyogha kutumbula ku Galilaya Yohanapakayomola kuwatangasila wandu ujumbi ghaki wa ubatiso. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mngumanya Yesu wa Nazaleti na vila Sapanga kamhaghula kwa kumpegha Mpumulo ghaki na uweso. Sapanga awelili pamonga namweni, mweni atyangili kula na kula akighola ghamaha na kuwalamisa wogha wawelili wahakilwa na makakala gha Lihyukana. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Twenga twa wandu tulola kwa mihu gha twenga weni mighalu hyogha agholili kumlima wa Wayahudi na ku Yelusalemu. Wamkomili kwa kumvamba kumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ila Sapanga amhindulili machuwa gha itatu, akamghola awoneki, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />kawoneka ng'ogha kwa wandu wogha, ila kwa twenga tulola kwa mihu gha twenga weni tuhaghulilwi na Sapanga. Ni twenga tulyeghili na kunywegha pamonga na mweni badili gha kuhinduka kwa mweni. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Atulaghilili kuitangasa Habali Maha kwa wandu wogha na kulongela yiwa mweni ndiwa ahaghulilwi na Sapanga aweli mlamula wa wavile wakomu na wahovili. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Walota wa Sapanga wogha wangumtangasa Yesu yiwa kila mundu atemkwinila atelekeselwa mahakata ghaki hyogha kwa lihina lyaki.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wangumpokela Mpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Lipindi Petelo paawelili anguyendelela kulonga milandu hila, Mpumulo wa Sapanga akawahulukila wogha wawelili wanguyoghanila ujumbi hula. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wala Wayahudi wakwinilili wahikili pamonga na Petelo kuhuma Yopa wakangasili kulola yiwa Sapanga kawaghulusilila hupo gha Mpumulo ghaki wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha kangi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kwaikiva wawayoghanilili wakilonga kwa luga wekaweka wakimyupa Sapanga. Baha Petelo akalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Wandu hagha wampokela Mpumulo wa Sapanga handa twenga baha tumpokelili. Ghuli, kuvile na mundu yoyosi atewesa kuwakanisa wakotoho kubatiswa kwa masi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Hinu akalaghila wabatiswi kwa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito. Hinu wakamluwa Petelo alikali na wala kwa machuwa mayaghani.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petelo anguwalongela Wayahudi habali zya Kolinelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wandumindumi na wakwinila Yesu kula Yudasia wayoghanilili yiwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha na weni wawelili wapokela lilando lya Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Hinu, Petelo paahuya Yelusalemu, wandu wamkwinila Yesu wala wawelili wayingila jandu, wakampingika Petelo wakilonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Wenga uyendili kutama na wandu wayingila jandu ng'ogha na hata ulyeghili pamonga na weni!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Baha Petelo akawalongela kwa umaha yala yagholekili kuhuma mtumbulo.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Akalonga, “Nenga niwelili kummbwani Yopa nikiyupa. Hinu nikakolwa na lughono, na nenga nikapokela mawonu. Nikalola lighololi likihuluka kuhuma kundumba, likolwili kweni pandi zyaki njechi. Likavikwa pabehi na nenga.” <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Panishughulila mghati ghaki kwa upabehi nikalola wakokolo wavile na maghulu njechi, wakokolo wa kumwitu, na wakokolo wa kukulughuka na wambongo wa kunani. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Hinu nikayoghanila lilowi likinilongela, “Petelo uyinuki, uhinji, ulyeghi.” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ila nenga nikayanga, “Ng'ogha, hata mayaghani, ee Bambu! Mghati gha mlomo wa nenga kuyingila chochosi kikaniswa na Sapanga na kipalwa ng'ogha kulyeghwa.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Lila lilowi likahyoghanika kangi kuhuma kundumba, “Ukotoho kukikema kindu chochosi kivile kipalwa ng'ogha kulyeghwa kindu kila Sapanga kalonga kya maha kulyeghwa wenga ukakikema yiwa kya maha ng'ogha kulyeghwa.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Na hagha milandu ikahyoghanika kangi mihanja itatu, hinu vindu vyogha vikahuyiswa kundumba. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Bwitu, wandu waitatu wawelili walaghilwa kwa nenga kuhuma Kaisalia wakahika na kugholoka kulighuta niwelili nikilikala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga akanilongela niyendi pamonga na wala na nikotoho kuwela na holu. Hagha walongu isita wakonganili na nenga kangi kuyenda Kaisalia na kula tuyingilili ukaya kwa Kolinelio. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kolinelio atulongelili vila kamlola Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kagholoka ukaya ghaki na kumlongela, “Myeghi mundu Yopa akamkemi mundu mmonga akemilwi Simoni, kwa lihina ghangi Petelo.” <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />“Mweni atekulongela milandu hyogha itekupala wenga na walongu ghako wa mlighuta ghako ili muwesi kulokoka.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Na nenga panitumbula kulongela, Mpumulo wa Sapanga awahulukilili handa atuhulukilili twenga pala mtumbulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ndiwa nikumbwikili milandu hila Bambu alongelili, “Yohana abatisili kwa masi, ila mwenga mtebatiswa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />“Hinu ikiva Sapanga awapeghili wala wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha hupo na ndiwa handa haihai atupeghili na twenga patumkwinila Bambu Yesu Kilisito, nenga ni ghani hata niwesi kumkingama Sapanga?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Wala walongo wakwinila pawayoghanila milandu hagha, wakaleka kungingama na kumkwilikiha Sapanga, wakilonga, “Chakaka Sapanga awapeghili hata wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha hilahila lukani wawesi kuleka sambi na kupokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wa haku ku Anitiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Hinu wakwinila wapaghanyikile kwaikiva gha mahakilo yahumilili na kihu kya Sitefano, wayendili kutali mbaka ku Foinike na ku Kipulo na ku Anitiokia na weni wawelili wakitangasa lila lilando kwa Wayahudi hela. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ila amonga gha wakwinila wahumili ku Kipulo na Kilene, wayendili ku Anitiokia wakautangasa hula ujumbi kwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wakilongela Habali Maha gha Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Makakala gha Bambu yawatangili na lipinga likulunga lya wandu wakwinilili na kumhyukila Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Habali gha mghalu hau uyoghanililwi kulila lipinga limkwinila Kilisito wa Yelusalemu. Nagha wakamlaghila Balinaba ayendi Anitiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Paahikili kula na kulola vila Sapanga awahighilili wala wandu, ahekilelili na kuwalongela wogha wayendeleli kumkwinila Bambu kwa mioyu ghao hyogha. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba awelili mundu wa maha na alongoswili na Mpumulo wa Sapanga na mweni kukwinila nesu. Lipinga likulunga lya wandu likweghilwi kwa Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Hinu, Balinaba ayendili Taso kumhakula Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Paamlolili Sauli, akamyegha Anitiokia. Na wogha waivili wakalikala na lila lipinga lya wakwinila Kilisito kwa lichuva lyogha wakilivula lipinga likulunga lya wandu. Ni kula Anitiokia ndiwa pavile wavulwa kwa lihanja lya mtumbulo kukemwa kwa lihina lya Wakilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Lipindi halihali, walota wa Sapanga wamonga wahikili Anitiokia kuhuma Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Hinu, mmonga ghao angukemwa Agabo agholokili, na kwa uweso wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga akalongela ghala yategholwa na Sapanga kuulongolo yiwa kutewela na njala ngulu kumlima wogha. Njala handa hai ihumilili lipindi lya ulongosi wa Kilaudio. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wala wavulwa wakalamula yiwa kila mmonga kwa uweso ghaki ayeghi chochosi ili kuwatanga wala wakwinila wawelili wangutama ku Yudasia. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Hinu, wakaghola havi kwa kuwapegha Balinaba na Sauli hila hupo wayeghi kwa wagogolo wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu angukomwa na Petelo anguwopwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Kulipindi lilalila Nkosi Helodi akatumbula kuwahakila wamonga wa lipinga lya wamkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Amkomili Yakobu mlongu ghaki Yohanakwa lipanga, <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />paalolili yiwa mghalu hula uwahekelelesa Wayahudi, akayendelela akamkamula Petelo kangi. Hai ihumililili lipindi lya mhambu wa mibumunda ivikilwi ng'ogha simika. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Badili gha kumkamula Petelo akamvika muuwopwa, pahi gha ugholokela wa vipinga vinjechi vya watovangondo vivile na watovangondo wanjechi kila kimonga na Helode aliwachilili kumvika panji kuluagha wamlamuli kuhova badili gha mhambu gha Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Hinu, Petelo paawelili muuwopwa, lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito liwelili lingumyupila kwa Sapanga kwa moyu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angulokolwa kuhuma muuwopwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Uhiku, pambila gha kuhika lichuwa lila Helodi angamuhumisa Petelo muluagha, Petelo awelili kawonja paghati gha watovangondo waivili. Awelili kawopwa minyololu miivili, na wagholokela wawelili wangugholokela kumlyangu wa mulighuta lya wawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bwitu, Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akagholoka pabehi na mweni na mhana ukalangasa kila kyumba kya lighuta lya wawopwa. Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamtika mulikombi akamyinula akilonga, “Ugholoki kwa kuloposela!” Bwitu ila minyololu imwopwili mumawoku ikadumuka na kugua pahi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamlongela, “Uliwopi luwoyi ghako, na uvali makobasi ghako.” Akaghola nagha. Hinu yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamlongela, “Vala likoti lyako, unikovekeli.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Hinu Petelo akahuka na mweni wakayenda panji gha lighuta lya wawopwa ila amanyili ng'ogha yiwa ghala yangugholwa na yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga yawelili gha uchakaka hinu aliwachilili yiwa ni mawonu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Waphitilili kukipinga kya watovangondo wawelili wakigholokela mlyango wa mtumbula na waivili, hinu wakahika kumlyangu wa lyuma wa kuhumila muuwopwa kuyingilila mumbwani. Hau mlyango ukajifughula weni, na weni wakahuma panji wakava wakityanga kunjila imonga na bwitu yula mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamleka Petelo wekaghaki.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Pala ndiwa Petelo paamanyili yahumilili, “Hinaa ningumanya kwa uchakaka yiwa Bambu amyeghili mtumikila ghaki wa kundumba akanilokola kumawoku gha Helodi na kuhuma kumighalu hyogha Wayahudi wayalindilili yanihumili.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Paamanyili nagha ayendili monga kwa monga mbaka mulighuta kwa Malia nyongo ghaki Yohanalihina lyaki ghangi ni Maliku. Mula wandu watangala wawelili walikungulili wakiyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petelo akatova mlyango wa panji, na mtumikila mmonga mhinja akemilwi Roda, akayenda mumlyango kuhyoghanila. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Hayu mhinja paamanyili lilowi lya Petelo akahekelela nesu, hata kafughula mlyango ng'ogha, akabhutuka mbilo mghati na kuwalongela wayaki yiwa “Petelo awelili kagholoka panji mumlyango.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Na weni wakamlongela, “Uvile na lukwali wenga!” Ila akayendelela kulonga yiwa ni uchakaka. Hinu wakalonga, “Hayu ni Mtumikila wa kundumba ghaki.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Kwa lipindi lila Petelo awelili anguyendelela kutova mlyango. kumwihu wakafughula mlyango, wakamlola, na kulikangasa nesu. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petelo akawapegha kilangihi kwa kuwapungila liwoku ili watami nuu, akawalongela vila Bambu amhumilili mulighuta lya wawopwa. Akawalongela kangi, “Hinu muwalongeli Yakobu na wamkwinila Kilisito ghangi” kuulongolo akahuka kuyenda mahala ghangi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Pakuchia, kuwelili na holu ngulu paghati gha wala watovangondo kwa ghala yawoneka kwa Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helodi akalaghila wamhakuli, ila wawesa ng'ogha kumlola. Nagha alaghilili wala watovangondo wakonywi, akalaghilila wakomwi. Hinu Petelo akahuka kula Yudasia, akayenda Kaisalia kula alikalili kwa lipindi lihupi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kihu kya Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Nkosi Helodi awelili na lilaka nesu na wandu wa mimbwani gha Tilo na Sidoni, ila weni wakamyeghela wajumbi. Na kwa mtumbulo wakawesa kumghola Bulasito avile upandi wa weni. Bulasito awelili mundu wa pabei na mgholokela mkulu wa lighuta lya Nkosi. Hinu, wakamyendela Helodi wakamluwa wavile na ndulumu, kwaikiva mlima ghao ulikwinilili mlima wa Nkosi kwa mulyo.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Lichuwa limonga lihaghulilwi, Helodi akiva kavala nguu zyaki zya Nkosi na kutama kukikalilo kya kinkosi, akawatangasila wandu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Wala wandu wakamtovela lilowi likulunga lya luheku wakilonga, “Hali ni lilowi lya Sapanga, gha mundu ng'ogha.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Na Palapala Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamguwisa Helodi pahi kwaikiva kampegha ng'ogha ukwilikihi Sapanga. Akalyeghwa na wang'ongolo.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Lilandu lya Sapanga likayendelela kulandala na kukula.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Na Balinaba na Sauli pawayomolili lihengu lyao, wakahuya ku Yelusalemu, wakiva pamonga na Yohana, wamkema hilahila Maliku.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli wanguhaghulilwa na kuyeghwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ku lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya kula Anitiokia kuwelili na wandu ghangi wawelili walota wa Sapanga na wavula wamonga gha weni wawelili Balinaba na Simoni wamkema kangi mpiile na Lukilo wa anguhuma kilene na Manaeni avile alelelilwi pamonga na nkosi Helodi na Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pawawelili wangumtundamila Bambu na kuwopa mulyo, Mpumulo wa Sapanga akalonga, “Mnitengeli Balinaba na Sauli kwa lihengu lila niwakemilili.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Badili gha kuyupa na kuwopa mulyo, wakawavikila mawoku, na kuwataula wayendi maha.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli wangutangasa Kupulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Hinu, Balinaba na Sauli pawalaghilwa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, wakahuluka mbaka Seleukia, na kuhuma kula wakwela whatu mbaka kighuhulu kya Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Na weni pawahikili mmbwani Salami, wakatangasa lilando lya Sapanga ku lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi. Yohana Maliku awelili pamonga na weni, akiwatanga kwa kughola lihengu.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Wakaghola mwanja ku mahala kogha gha mlima Kupulo na wakahika kulihungu limonga walikema Pafo haku wakamlola mundu mmonga mhawi lihina lyaki wamkema Baaliyesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Mundu hayu awelili ndundami wa Seligio Paulo, mkulu wa lila lihunguli, awelili mundu mweni luhala nesu. Seligio Paulo awakemili Balinaba na Sauli ili ahyoghanili lilando lya Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ila hayu mhawi Baaliyesu avile lihina lyaki kwa kigiliki ni Elima, ayesili kuwangingama Balinaba na Sauli ili kukanisa yula mkulu wa lihunguli akotoho kuhyuka akamkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Hinu Sauli, angukemwa hilahila Paulo, ikiva angulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, akamtumbulila mihu nesu yula mhawi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />na kulonga, “Wenga mwana wa Lihyukana na muhakata wa mighalu hyogha gha maha! Umemeswa na ukambenga wa mahakata na kuyesa kughola uchakaka wa Bambu kuvile uhwangi. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Hinaa, uweso wa Bambu utekunjokola. Utevile ungalimihu na utewesa ng'ogha kulola mhana wa lijuwa kwa lipindi litenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bwitu kila kindu kikavile handa likungweta lya lwisa kwa mweni, akatumbula kuyenda kogha na kogha akihakula mundu wa kumkola liwoko amlongosi. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yula mkulu wa lihungulu paalolili hagha, akamkwinila Bambu kwaikiva alikangasilwi nesu na mavulo gha Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Paulo wanguyenda Anitiokia gha Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kuhuma Pafo, Paulo na wayaki wakwelili whatu wakayenda mbaka Pelige kumlima wa Pamfilia. Ila Yohana Maliku awalekili, akahuya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ila weni wayendelelili na mwanja kuhuma ku Pelige mbaka kumbwani Anitiokia gha Pisidia. Lichuwa lya kupumulila wayingilili mghati gha lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi, watamili. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Badili gha kuyomola kusoma kumayandiko gha kihitabu kya Laghililo lya Musa na ku mayandiko gha walota, wakulu wa lila lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi wakawayeghela ujumbi hau, “Walongu, ikiva mvile na mghalu wa kuwalongela wandu ili kuwataya moyu, muwalongeli.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Hinu, Paulo akagholoka, akayinula liwoku kuwaponga ili kuwaghola watami nuu. Akalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Mwenga Waizilaili wayangu na Wayahudi ng'ogha na wogha mngumtundamila Sapanga, mhyoghanili,” <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Sapanga wa wandu wa Izilaili awahaghulili mambuyi wa twenga, awagholili wandu hagha wavile mlima Mkulunga pawawelili wakilikala kuuhenja kula Misili na Sapanga awahumisili kula kwa uweso ghaki mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Awavumilili kwa machuva ialobaini mulivagha. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Paayalamisili milima isaba gha Kanani akawapegha wandu ghaki hila milima ivile ulihi wa weni. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Hagha hyogha yagholokili kwa machuva imia inne na iamsini badili gha hagha awapeghili walamula ili wawalongosi mbaka lipindi lya Samweli mlota wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ndiwa wandu wakaluwa wapeghwi nkosi, na Sapanga akawapegha Sauli, mwana wa Kishi, wa likabila lya Benjamini awalongolili kwa machuva ialobaini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Badili gha Sapanga kumuhumisa Sauli akamghola Daudi avile nkosi wa weni. Na mweni baha Sapanga akalonga, “Nijihaghulili Daudi mwana wa Yese, ni mundu anguyendana na moyu wa nenga, mundu avile ateghola yala hyogha ninguyapala kuyaghola.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Na kuhuma kuuwelekwa wa mundu hayu Sapanga kawayeghela Waizilaili mlokola, na hayu ndiwa Kilisito, handa vila awelili kawalaghila. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Pambila gha Yesu kutumbula kughola lihengu, Yohanaamlongolili akitangasila wandu wogha wa Izilaili yiwa wangupalwa waleki mahakata na kubatiswa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohanapaawelili pabehi na kuyomola lihengu lyaki akalonga, “Mnguwachila nenga ni ghani? Nenga nivile ng'ogha yula mngumlindila. Hayu ahika badili gha nenga na nenga nahela uweso hata kuwoposola ngoyi zya makobasi ghaki.”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Walongu ghangu, wana wa uwelekwa wa Ibulahimu, na mwenga mvile Wayahudi ng'ogha wogha mungumuyitikila Sapanga, habali hai gha kulokoka iyeghwa kwa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwaikiva wenikaya wa Yelusalemu na wakulu ghao wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa mweni ni mlokola, kangi wamanyili ng'ogha milandu gha walota wa Sapanga yasomilwi kwa weni kila lichuwa lya kupumulila. Hinu wakaghola milandu gha walota wa Sapanga yatimili kwa kumlamula Yesu kihu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Hata ikavile wamlola ng'ogha na mahakata gha kumghola akomwi, wamluwili Pilato amtosi akomwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Na pawayomola kughola ghala hyogha yayandikwa kumlongela Yesu, wakamuhulusa kuhuma kulipingika na kumsika. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ila Sapanga akamuhindula. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Na mweni, kwa machuwa yatangala, awahumilili wala wawelili wakimkovekela kuhuma ku Galilaya mbaka Yelusalemu na hagha ndiwa wala hinaa wanguwesa kulongela kwa wandu wa Izilaili. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Na twenga tuhika baha kuwayeghela Habali Maha. Mghalu hula Sapanga awalaghilili mbuyi wa twenga, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />hinaa kayaghola kwa twenga wana wa weni, kwa kumuhindula Yesu, handa iyandikiliwi ku Zabuli gha ivili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘wenga ni mwana wa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">lelo nenga nikulela.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Na kwa kuhinduka kwa Yesu, ili lukani awese ng'ogha kuwola, Sapanga alongili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Nitekupegha wenga highili zyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">zila nimlaghilili Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Hilahila kumahala ghangi gha Zabuli alonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Utemleka ng'ogha mtumikila ghako mghola lihengu kwa uchakaka awole.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Lipindi Daudi akilikala, aigholili ghala hyogha ayapalili Sapanga kwa wandu wa kiwelekwa kyaki, hinu akahova na kusikwa pabehi na wagogolo ghaki, na lindumbi lyaki likawola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ila hayu Sapanga amhindulili kuhuma kukihu kawola ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Kwa nagha, mmanyi, walongo ghangu Waizilaili, kwa kupitila hayu Yesu ujumbi wa kulekeselwa mahakata ungutangaswa kwa mwenga, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na hinu, kwa Yesu kila yula amkwinila anguvalangilwa umaha kumighalu hyogha hila awesa ng'ogha kwa kupitila laghililo lya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Nagha, mkali mihu ili yala walongelili walota wa Sapanga yakotoho kuwakola:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Mlikali mihu mwenga mvile na mapughanyo mkalikangasi na kuhova!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">kwaikiva niteghola mghalu kumachuwa gha mwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hali mtelikwinila ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata mundu akiwalongela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulo na Balinaba pawawelili wanguhuma kulila lighuta lya kutundamila Wayahudi, wala wandu wakawaluwa wahiki kangi lichuwa lya kupumulila lya kuulongolo, ili walongeleli kwa utali mighalu hila. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Kukonganika haku pakuyomola, Wayahudi watangala na Wayahudi ng'ogha wala wahyukili na kuwela wakwinila wa dini gha Kiyahudi wakawakovekela Paulo na Balinaba. Wala wandumindumi wakalongela na wandu wala, na wakawapegha moyu wayendeleli kulikala ku ulungwana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Lichuwa lya kupumulila palihika, pabehi wandu wogha wa hula mmbwani wahikili kuhyoghanila lilando lya Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ila Wayahudi pawalolili lila lipinga lya wandu wakamemeswa wifu, wakakingama kila awelili angulonga Paulo na wakamlighu. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Hinu Paulo na Balinaba wakawayanga kwa kugangamala, “Ingupalwa kulonga mwenga lilando lya Sapanga mtumbulo, kwa vila mlilema na kujivalangila mwenga yiwa ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela unguwapala ng'ogha, hinaa, tunguwaleka na kuwayendela wala wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwaikiva hali ndiwa Bambu atulaghilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nikuvika wenga uvile mhana kwa wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">ili wandu wogha mlima wogha wapokeli ulokola,’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />lipindi wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha pawayoghanila milandu hagha wakahekelela, wakaukwilikiha ujumbi wa Sapanga, na wala wawelili wahaghulilwi kupokela ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela, wakakwinila.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Lilandu lya Bambu likalandala kumlima hula wogha. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ila Wayahudi wakawatumisila wakulu wammbwani hula pamonga na wadala wamonga wavile na utundamilo wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi na wakovekela dini gha Kiyahudi. Na weni wakawatumisila wandu wawahakili Paulo na Balinaba hata wakawawinga kuhuma kumlima ghao. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Hinu, Paulo na Balinaba wakapumunda lifu liwelili kumaghulu ghao handa kilangihi kya kuwangingama, na wakayenda Ikonia. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ila wala wavulwa wa ku Anitiokia wakawela na luheku na wakalongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba kula Ikonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Paulo na Balinaba pawahikili kummbwani Ikonia, wakayingila hilahila kulighuta lya kutundamila Wayahudi. Mula wakatangasa hata lipinga likulunga lya wayahudi na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wakakwinila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ila wayahudi ghangi wala wakwinila ng'ogha wakawapapusa wala Wayahudi ng'ogha na kuwavikila mawachilo mahakata kumioyu ghao ili wawangingami wala walongu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Hinu Paulo na Balinaba watamili Ikonia kwa lipindi litali. Walongelili kwa makakala nesu habali gha Bambu. Na mweni awapeghili uweso wa kughola mkangaso na vilaghihi. Na kwa njila hai ahighilisili yiwa ujumbi wautangasili kwa ulungwana ghaki uwelili wa chakaka. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Wandu wammbwani hula wakapalaghanyika, Wamonga wakawela upandi wa Wayahudi na ghangi upandi wa wandumindumi.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mwihu, wandu wamonga Wayahudi ng'ogha na Wayahudi, wakighola pamonga na wakulu ghao, wavikili lukani lya kuwaghola mahakata hagha wandumindumi na kuwatova maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Wandumindumi pawamanyili mghalu hau, wakahukila ku Lisitila na Delibe, mimbwani gha Lukoania, na kumahala pabehi na pala, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />wakiva wangutangasa Habali Maha kula.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba kula Lisitila na Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Kuwelili na mundu mmonga kula Lisitila avile kawela mlemafu wa maghulu kuhuma kuuwelekwa, na kawesa ng'ogha kutyanga. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Mundu hayu awelili angumhyoghanila Paulo paawelili angutangasa. Paulo amlolili kwa maheli, na paalolili yiwa kana ukwinila wa kuwesa kulamiswa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Paulo akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Gholoka kwa maghulu ghako.” Hayu mundu awelili mlemafu wa maghulu akayinuka na kujumba akatumbula kutyanga. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lipinga lya wandu pawalolili vila agholili Paulo, watumbulili kutova lilowi kwa luga gha Kilukanio, “Milungu ituhikilila ikiva kumihigha gha wandu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Balinaba wakamkema Zeu, na Paulo, kwa vila mweni ndiwa awelili angulonga, wakamkema Helimesi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Na mweni mtambika wa lighuta lya Mlungu Zeu liwelili panji gha mmbwani akayegha ng'ombi makambaku na mapambu gha uluwa kuulongolo gha mlyango mkulu wammbwani, na mweni pamonga na lila lipinga lya wandu akapala kuwatolela litambiku wandumindumi.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ila Balinaba na Paulo pawayoghanilili habali hila, wakalakatula nguu zyao na kubhutuka mbilo ku lila lipinga lya wandu wakilonga kwa lilowi likulunga, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Walongu, kwa liki mngughola mighalu handa hagha? Twenga hilahila ni wandu handa mwenga, Na twa baha kuwatangasila Habali Maha, muwesi kuleka havi vindu vya kuhongola mkamhyukile Sapanga avile mkomu, yula agholili kundumba na mlima wogha, na bahali na vyogha vya mghati. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Kula dahile Sapanga awalekili wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha wakovekeli yala wanguyapala. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Hata nagha, Sapanga alekili ng'ogha kujihighilisa kwa mighalu maha ghala anguwagholela. Huwahulusila ndonya kuhuma kunani, ili waweli na mabeno kwa lipindi lyake na kuyukwite na kuimemesa mioyu gha mwenga luheku.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Paulo na Balinaba wakawesa kulilemesa lila lipinga likotoho kuyegha litambiku kwa weni ila iwelili ng'ogha yuyughu kuwalemesa wakotoho kuwapegha litambiku.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ila Wayahudi wamonga wahikili kuhuma Anitiokia na Ikonia, wakawaghola wandu wakongine na weni, wakamtova maganga Paulo na kumghalahusa na kumkulughula mbaka panji gha mmbwani wakiwachila avile kahova kala. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ila wakwinila pawawelili wakimtindila, akagholoka na kuhuya mghati gha mmbwani. Kilau ghaki mweni pamonga na Balinaba wakayenda mmbwani Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba wanguhuya mmbwani Anitiokia gha mlima wa Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Badili gha Paulo na Balinaba kutangasa Habali Maha kula Delibe na kupokela wakwinila watangala, Hinu wakahuya kummbwani wa Listra, wa Ikonia na wa Anitiokia gha mlima wa Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawapeghili makakala wakwinila wa mimbwani hila na kuwapegha moyu wayendeleli kulikala kuuyitikila. Wakawalongela, “Tungupalwa twenga wogha kupitila kumahakili yatangala ili tuyingili kuunkosi wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Wakawahaghula wandu wakomi kulila lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. Badili gha kuyupa na kuleka kulyegha mulyo, wakawavika pahi gha ugholokela wa Bambu wamyitikilili.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Badili gha kupitila kumlima gha Pisidia, wahikili kumlima Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Pawayomola kutangasa hula ujumbi kula Peliga, watyangili ku Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kuhuma kula wakakwela whatu wakahuya Anitiokia ni kula mtumbulo pala dahile wawelili wawatakila highili kwaikiva gha lihengu lya Sapanga livile hinaa waliyomola kala.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Pawahikili kula Anitiokia wagholili mkongano wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya mahala pala, wakawapegha habali gha mighalu Sapanga awawesesili kughola, na vila paawawoposolili wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha mlyango wa kuyingila kuukwinila. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Wakalikala pamonga na wala wamkwinila Kilisito kwa machuwa yatangala.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Njengakaya ngulu haku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Hinu, amonga gha wandu wahikili Anitiokia kuhuma Yudasia wakatumbula kuwavula wala wamkwinila Kilisito wakilonga, “Ikiva myingila jandu ng'ogha kuyendana na mavulo handa alaghilili Musa, mtewesa ng'ogha kulokolwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Hinu Paulo na Balinaba wakakingama na kusindana nesu na wala kwa mighalu hila. Na kwa nagha wavulwa wakalaghila Paulo na Balinaba pamonga na wandu ghangi paghati ghao wayendi Yelusalemu kulongela na wandumindumi na wagogolo wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito kwa milandu hila.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Hinu Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya ku Anitiokia wakawalaghila, Paulo na wayaki na weni wakapitila kumlima Foinike na ku Samalia. Na kula wakawalongela vila wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wamkwinila Yesu. Habali hai ikahekelesa nesu walongu wogha wamkwinila Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pawahika ku Yelusalemu wapokelilwi na lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito, wandumindumi na wagogolo na weni wakawapegha habali hyogha Sapanga ayagholili pamonga na weni. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ila wavulwa ghangi wawelili wa lipinga lya Mafalisayo wagholokili, wakalonga, “Ingupalwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wayingili jandu na kuvulwa kulikovekela laghililo lya Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Hinu wandumindumi na wagogolo wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Yesu wakakonganika ili walolesi mghalu hula. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Badili gha malongelano yatangala, Petelo akagholoka na kulongela, “Walongu wa nenga, mngumanya yiwa Sapanga anihaghulili machuwa gha mtumbulo paghati gha mwenga lukani nitangasi Habali Maha kwa Wayahudi ng'ogha wawesi kuhyoghanila na kumkwinila Bambu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na mweni Sapanga angumanya mioyu gha wandu, ahighilisili yiwa kawapokela kwa kuwapegha Mpumulo wa Sapanga handa atupeghili twenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Sapanga kaghola ng'ogha uhaghulo wowosi paghati gha twenga na weni, alekeselili mahakata ghao kwaikiva wamkwinila. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Hinu hinaa, kwa kyani kumyesa Sapanga kwa kuwapapisa mihigu wala wamkwinila Kilisito hata wambuyi wa twenga na twenga tuwesa ng'ogha kupapa? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ingupalwa ng'ogha kuvile nagha, ila tungukwinila yiwa, twenga handa weni, tutelokolwa kwa kupitila ulungwana wa Bambu Yesu Kilisito.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Hinu mkongano wogha ukatama nuu ukiyoghanila milandu gha Balinaba na Paulo pawawelili wakilongela vila Sapanga agholili kwa kupitila gha weni paghati gha wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Na wala pa wayomolili kulongela, Yakobu akayanga, akilonga, “Walongo wanenga mniyoghanile. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni katulongela vila Sapanga pala mtumbulo kawagholela mighalu gha maha wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha, akahaghula wamonga ghao wavile wandu ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Na mghalu hau ungulandana nesu na milandu gha walota wa Sapanga handa iyandikwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Bambu angulonga nagha, ‘Badili gha kupiti mighalu hagha nitehuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuchenga kangi lila liboma lya Daudi liguwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">nitechenga maboma gha dahile yaguwili na niteghola yavile maha. <verse eid="ACT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Pala wandu ghangi wogha watehika kwa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha niwakema wavile wa nenga watenikovekela nenga Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Angulonga Bambu yula agholayi mighalu hyogha kuhuma dahile.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobu akayendelela kulonga, “Hau ndiwa ulamula ghangu, tukotoho kuwaghasa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wala wangumhyukila Sapanga kwa kuwalongela wakovekeli mighalu gha twenga tuighola kila lelo.” <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ila ingupalwa tuwayandikile lihamba kwa kuwalongela yiwa wakotoho kulyegha mulyo ukaniswa na Sapanga kwa kuyeghwa handa litambiku na milungu gha kuhongolwa, walikali kutali na ngongola na wakotoho kulyegha likokolu lolosi lihinjwa ng'ogha kangi wakotoho kunywegha mwahi. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />“Kwaikiva kwa lipindi litali milandu gha Musa iwelili ikitangaswa mahala wekaweka mmbwani na kusomwa ku maghuta gha kutundamila Wayahudi kila lichuwa lya kupumulila.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihamba kwa wandu wamkwinila Yesu wala Wayahudi ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Wandumindumi na wagogolo na lighuta lyogha wapalili kuwahaghula wandu wamonga paghati gha weni na kuwayegha Anitiokia pamonga na Paulo na Balinaba. Hinu, wakamhaghula Yudasi akemilwi Balisaba, na Sila wavile wogha wawelili wangumanyikana nesu paghati gha walongu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Wakawalaghila na lihamba ingulonga,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Twenga wandumindumi na wagogolo, na walongu wa mwenga, tunguwajambusa mwenga walongu Wayahudi ng'ogha mvile haku ku Anitiokia, na Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tuyoghanilili yiwa wandu wamonga kuhuma haku kwa twenga wawakologhanyilili kwa milandu ghao, wakaivika mioyu gha mwenga ku holu. Ila wagholili hali laghililo kwa kuyeghwa ng'ogha na twenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Nagha, tulamulili kwa pamonga kuwahaghula wandu ghangi na kuwayegha kwa mwenga pamonga na wapalwa wa twenga Balinaba na Paulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />wandu wayitikilili kwa kuvika ukomu ghao hata kukuhova kwaikiva gha kumtumikila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kwa nagha, tunguwayegha Yudasi na Sila kwa mwenga, na weni watewalongela yala tuyaandikili. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Hinu, Mpumulo wa Sapanga na twenga tuyitikila tukotoho kuwapapisa mihigu mitopehu ipiti hagha wangupalwa kuyaghola. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mkotoho kulyegha mulyo utambikilwa kwa kuyeghwa handa litambiku na milungu gha kuhongolwa, mkotoho kunywegha mwahi, mkotoho kulyegha likokolo lipopotolwa na waleki ungongola. Mteghola maha nesu ikiva mtehyeta kughola mighalu hagha. Wasalaam.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Badili gha kuwataula, wala wajumbi wakahuka na kuyenda kumbwani Anitiokia. Kula wakawakema lipinga lyogha lya wakwinila, na wakawapegha lihamba hila. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Pawaisomili hila lihamba, milandu ghaki ikawapegha moyu, wakahekelela nesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudasi na Sila, na weni wawelili walota wa Sapanga, hinu wakalongela na wala walongu kwa lipindi litali wakiwapegha moyu na kuwachenga kuukwinila. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Na badili gha kulikala kula kwa lipindi litenu, walongu wa Anitiokia wakawataula kwa upalo, hinu wakahuya kwa wala wawelili wawalaghila. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ila Sila akalola ni maha kuyendelela kulikala kula.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulo na Balinaba waghihalili kula Anitiokia kwa lipindi, wakavula na kutangasa lilando lya Bambu, pamonga na wandu ghangi watangala.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba wangulekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Badili gha machuwa mayaghani, Paulo akamlongela Balinaba, “Tuhuyi hinaa tukawatyangili walongu kumimbwani mula tutangasilili lilando lya Bambu, tukawalole vila wanguyendelela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balinaba apalili wayendi pamonga na Yohana, amanyika hilahila kwa lihina lya Maliku. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ila Paulo apalili ng'ogha kuyenda na Maliku, kwaikiva awelili kalekana na weni kula Pamfilia alemili kuyendelela kughola lihengu na weni. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kwa nagha Paulo na Balinaba wakasindana nesu hata wakalekana. Balinaba akahuka pamonga na Maliku, wakayingila mghati gha whatu na kuyenda ku Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Na mweni Paulo akamhaghula Sila, na akahuka badili gha walongu kuwayupila highili gha Bambu iyendi pamonga na weni. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ku mwanja hau Paulo akapitila ku mimbwani gha Silia na Kilikia, akiyataya makakala mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoseo angulongolana na Paulo na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo ahikili Delibe na Lisitila, kuwelili na myitikila mmonga akemilwi Timoseo. Nyongo ghaki awelili Muyahudi, na mweni awelili akwinila ila tati ghaki awelili Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoseo akwinililwi na wala walongu wa Lisitila na Ikonia. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo apalili Timoseo walongolani na mweni mmwanja, kwa nagha amyingilisili jandu. Agholili nagha kwaikiva Wayahudi wogha walikalili pandi zila wamanyili yiwa tati ghaki Timoseo awelili Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pawawelili wangutyanga kumimbwani wawapeghili wandu yala malaghililo wapeghilwi na wandumindumi na wagogolo wa wandu wamkwinila Yesu Kilisito kula Yelusalemu, na wakawaluwa wayakoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nagha, yala mapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito yaendelelili kuvile na makakala kuukwinila, na lipinga lya wakwinila liyongesekili kila lichuwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angupokela mawonu kula Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paulo na wayaki wapitila kumimbwani gha Fulugia na Galatia, wakiva walemeswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga wakotoho kutangasa Habali Maha kula Asia hyogha. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pawahika kummbaka gha mmbwani wa Musia, wapalili kuyingila kumumbwani Bitunia, ila Mpumulo wa Yesu kawalongela kawalekesela ng'ogha wayingile. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Hinu, wapitili Musia, wakayenda mbaka wakahika kummbwani Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Lipindi lya uhiku, Paulo akapokela mawonu yavile amwonili mundu mmonga wa Makidonia agholokili pala na kumluwa, “Hubhuka, uhiki Makidonia ututangi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Badili gha Paulo kupokela mawonu ghala, tukaliyandala mwanja kuyenda Makidonia kwa kuloposela, tukijihighilisila yiwa Sapanga atukemili tuwatangasile Habali Maha haku Makidonia.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidia angumkwinila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kuhuma Tiloa, Tuyendili mwanja kwa whatu mbaka ku Samotilake, na kilau ghaki tukagholosa whatu ku Neapoli ili tughuluki. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kuhuma kula tuyendili mwanja wa maghulu mbaka Filipi, mmbwani mkulu wa Makidonia mmbwani hula ulongosilwi na wandu wa Ulumi. Tulikalili kummbwani hula kwa machuwa mayaghani. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Lichuwa lya kupumulila tuhumili panji gha mmbwani, tukayenda mmbali gha lweni tukiliwachila ni mahala pa Wayahudi kuyupa. Tutamili pahi, tukalongela na wadala walikungulili mahala pala. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mmonga wa wala watuyoghanilili avile mdala myupa Sapanga akemilwi Lidia mwenikaya wa Tuatila, avile anguwusa nguu zya zambalau. Bambu akaghubutula moyu ghaki hata akapokela hila milandu Paulo avile angulonga. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Badili gha hayu mdala pamonga na walongu ghaki kubatiswa, atuluwili tuhiki ukaya kwa mweni akilonga, “Ikiva uchakaka mmlola yiwa nenga ningumkwinila Bambu, mhiki ukaya kwa nenga mkatami.” Akatuluwa nesu tuyendi.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila wanguwopwa mlighuta lya wawopwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Lichuwa limonga, patuwela tunguyenda mahala kuyupa, mhinja mmonga awelili na lihyukana limuwesesa kutunga ndunga akongine na twenga. Mhinja hayu awelili anguwaghola wandu wamtumili kughola lihengu lya kutunga ndunga wapokeli mapesa ngoo na hindu ngoo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Hinu, hayu mhinja amkovikilili Paulo na twenga, akitova lilowi na kulonga, “Hagha wandu ni watumikila wa Sapanga avile kunani nesu. Wanguwatangasila njila gha kulokolwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Awelili angughola nagha kwa machuwa yatangala hata lichuwa limonga Paulo ahyomili, akamhyukila na kumlongela yula lihoka, “Ningukulaghila kwa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito, muhumi hayu.” Na lisaa lilalila lihoka likahuka.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Wandu wamtumilili yula mhinja pawalolili yiwa ukwinila gha kupokela mapesa kwa weni unguhuka wakawakamula Paulo na Sila wakawakulughula mbaka paluagha, kuulongolo gha walamula. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Badili gha kuwayegha kwa vilongosi wa Waloma, wakalongela walamula, “Wandu hagha ni Wayahudi, na weni wanguukologhanya mmbwani wa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wanguwavula wakolamlima mighalu hila ivile lilaghililo lya twenga wandu wa Loma lingukanila kuhyoghanila na kukovekela.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Hinu lipinga lya wandu liwelili pala likatumbula kuwapundangila Paulo na Sila, na weni vilongosi wakalaghila wawawopoli nguu kwa makakala na kuwatova hiyatu. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Badili gha kutovwa nesu wakavikwa mghati, na mgholokela wa lighuta lya wawopwa akalaghila kuwavika pahi gha ugholokela mkalipa. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kwa kukovekela malaghilo hagha, yula mgholokela akawavika mukyumba kya mghati nesu kya lighuta lya wawopwa na kuwawopa maghulu ghao ku mahimbati makulunga. <figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16:24">Wandu waivili wawopwa maghulu ghao mahimbati makulunga</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Pabehi na uhiku wa mandandu Paulo na Sila wawelili wakiyupa na kuyimba uyimbo wekaweka wa kumuyinula Sapanga, kunu wawopwa ghangi wakiva wanguyoghanila. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bwitu, kukahumila mhihimu mkulunga wa mlima hata kitumbulo kya lighuta gha wawopwa kikahihimila na palapala milyango hyogha gha muuwopwa ikawopoka na minyololu gha wawopwa wogha ikadumuka na vihungo kuwopoka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Yula mgholokela akayimuka, na mweni paalola yiwa milyango gha lighuta lya wawopwa iwela lipala, akahomola lipanga lyaki ili alikomi, kwa ikiva awachilili yiwa wawopwa wahukili. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ila Paulo akakema kwa lilowi likulunga, “Ukotoho kulikoma mweni kwa ikiva twenga wogha twabaha.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Hayu mgholokela akapala limbamba liyeghwi na palihika limbamba, akabhutukila mghati, akajidanga kuulongolo gha maghulu gha Paulo na Sila kunu akihihimila kwa holu. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Hinu akawalongosa panji na kuwakonya, “Wabambu ghangu, nigholi kyani mbati kulokoka?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Weni wakamyanga, “Mkwinili Bambu Yesu na wenga utelokoka pamonga na walongu ghako wogha.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Hinu, wakamtangasila lilando lya Bambu mweni pamonga na wandu wogha wavile mghati ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Yula mgholokela akawatola lisaa lilalila gha uhiku akawaghulula vilonda vya weni, hinu mweni na walongu ghaki wabatisilwi lipindi lilalila. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kangi akawatola Paulo na Sila mbaka ukaya ghaki, akawapegha mulyo. Mweni na walongu ghaki wogha wakamema na luheku kwa ikiva hinaa wavile wangumkwinila Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Kilau ghaki pamuhi, vilongosi wa waloma wakawalaghilila watovangondo ghao wakilonga, “Muwawoposoli wala wandu, muwaleki wayendi.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Yula mgholokela amlongelili kangi Paulo yiwa, “Walamula walaghilili yiwa wenga na Sila muwoposolwe. Hinaa mnguwesa kuhuma na kuyenda kwa holu ng'ogha.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ila Paulo akawayanga, “Ikiva tughola ng'ogha uhakata, wakatutova hyatu mahala paluagha na twenga ni wandu wa Loma. Kangi, watuvikili mulighuta lya wawopwa na hinaa wangulaghila watuleki tuyendi kwa kughiha! iwesekana ng'ogha! Ingupalwa hagha weni wahiki baha watuwopoli.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Wala watovangondo wakawalongela mighalu hagha walamula, na weni pawayoghanila yiwa Paulo na Sila wavile wandu wa Loma, watilili nesu. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Nagha, wayendili kuwaluwa kwa hula uhakata wawagholili na badili gha kuwahumisa mlighuta lya wawopwa wawaluwili wahuki kummbwani hula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paulo na Sila wahumili mulighuta lya wawopwa, wakayenda ukaya kwa Lidia. Kula wawawonili walongu wamkwinila Kilisito na pawayomola kuwataya moyu wakayenda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila kula Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulo na Sila wakaghola mwanja kupitila Amufipoli na Apolonia, mbaka Tesalonike na kula kuwelili na lighuta lya kutundamila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulo akayingila na weni handa aigholili machuwa hyogha, akalongelana na weni machuwa gha kupumulila maitatu yakovekelanili akitumila Mayandiko gha Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Awalongelili kwa kulaghiha lipalalipala yiwa impalili Kilisito kuhakilwa na kuhinduka kuhuma kukihu. Akawalongela, “Yesu yula nenga ningumlongela kwa mwenga ndiwa Kilisito.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wamonga gha Wayahudi wakakwinila wakakovekelana na Paulo na Sila. Hilahila, lipinga likulunga lya Wagiliki wamtundamilili Sapanga pamonga na wadala watangala wavile na uweso.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ila Wayahudi wakalongoswa na wifu, hata wakakungula wandu wamaha ng'ogha wa mnjila kuhuma kusoku, na kughola lipinga. Hinu wakaghola mkologhanyo kummbwani wogha. Wakavamila lighuta lya mundu akemilwi Yasoni, wakiwahakula Paulo na Sila lukani wawayeghi kuulongolo gha wandu wa mlima. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ila wawawonili ng'ogha hinu wakamkulughula Yasoni na walongo ghangi kuulongolo gha wakulu wa mmbwani, wakitova lilowi “Wandu hagha ndiwa wala waghalambulili mlima wogha hinu wahika na haku,” <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni ndiwa kawapokela mlighuta lya mweni. Hagha wogha wangughola mighalu ivile kiyetu kya laghililo lya Kaisali wakilonga yiwa, “Kuvile na nkosi ghangi wamkema Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kwa milandu hagha wawatayili holu wakulu wa mmbwani na lipinga lya wandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Wakulu wammbwani pawayomolili kuwaghola wahipe mapesa wakawaleka wayendi.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila kummbwani Beloya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Uhiku hulahula, wala wavulwa wakawalongosa Paulo na Sila wayendi kwa kuloposela ku Beloya. Na pawahikili kula, wakayingila kulighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wandu wa kula ku Beloya wawelili wanguyoghanila nesu wapiti wala wa Tesaloniki. Waupokelili hula ujumbi kwa kuupala nesu, wakiva wanguyalolesa mayandiko makwilikihi kila lichuwa, ili kulola yiwa wayalongelili Paulo na Sila yawelili ni uchakaka. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Hinu Wayahudi watangala wakamkwinila Yesu pamonga na wadala wa kigiliki wavile na uweso na walumi wa kigiliki. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ila, Wayahudi wa Tesalonike pawamanya yiwa Paulo awelili angutangasa lilando lya Sapanga kula Beloya, watyangili kula, wakatumbula kughola mkologhanyo na kuchongesela malipinga gha wandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Wala walongu wakammbua Paulo kwa kuloposela ayendi mmbali mwa bahali ila Sila na Timoseo wakahighala ku Beloya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wala walongu wammbulili Paulo wakayenda na mweni mbaka Asene. pawayomola kummbua, wakahuya pamonga na malaghililo kuhuma kwa Paulo yiwa Sila na Timoseo wayendi kwa kuloposela nesu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulongela na wandu wa Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulo paawelili anguwalindila Sila na Timoseo kula Asene, akahyoma nesu paalolili yiwa mmbwani hula uwelili umema milungu gha kuhongola. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Awelili akilongelana na Wayahudi na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wamkwinili Sapanga kulighuta lya kutundamilila wayahudi . Hilahila alongelanilili kila lichuwa na wandu awawonili mahala paluagha pamonga na wogha wala akonganilili na weni. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wavula wamonga wa lilipinga lya Waepikulio na lya Wasitoiko, wakatumbula kusindana na Paulo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Ghangi walongili, “Hayu bambu kilomolomo angupala kulongela niki?” Ghangi walongili, “Inguwoneka angulongela habali gha milungu gha kihenja” Kwa ikiva Paulo awelili angulonga Habali Maha zya Yesu na kwa uhinduki wa wandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Hinu wakamtola Paulo, na kumyegha kuulongolo gha njengakaya gha wamanyi ingukemwa “Aleopago,” wakamlongela. “Tungupala kumanya mghalu hau hyonu uwelili unguulongelela.” <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />“Kwa ikiva ungutulongela mighalu gha kukangasa. Hinu tungupala kumanya mighalu hagha ungumanisa liki?” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Wandu wa Asene na wahenja walikalili kula wawelili wakitumila lipindi lyao lyogha kulongelelana na kuhyoghanila habali hyonu hyonu.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Hinu, Paulo agholokili kuulongolo gha njengakaya gha Aleopago, akalonga, “Wandu wa Ugiliki! Ningulola yiwa mwenga, kwa vyovyosi, ni wandu mpala nesu kumtundamila Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwa ikiva paniwelili nikityanga kogha na kogha nilola vindu vya kuhongola vya kutundamila niwonili kihanja kimonga kiyandikilwi, ‘Kwa Sapanga amanyika ng'ogha.’ Hinu, hayu mumyupa na mumanya ng'ogha, ndiwa yula ningumtangasa kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Sapanga, yula agholili mlima wogha na vyogha vivile mghati, ni Bambu wa kundumba na mlima wogha, mweni kalikala ng'ogha kulighuta lya Sapanga lichengwa na wandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Angutumikilwa ng'ogha kwa mawoko gha wandu handa vila angupala chochosi kila, kwaikiva mweni ndiwa anguwapegha wandu ukomu, anguwawesesa kupumula na kuwapegha kila kindu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kuhuma kwa mundu mmonga Sapanga agholili milima hyogha na kuiwesesa kulama kumlimawogha. Mweni kuhuma dahile avikili lipindi yiwa kugha milima hagha itelikala. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Sapanga agholili nagha, ili milima hagha iwesi kumkovekela, na handa vila kwa kuyavisayavisa, yawesi kumhikila. Hata nagha, Sapanga avile ng'ogha kutali na kila mmonga wa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Handa mundu mmonga ailongile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘kwa mweni tungulama, tungutyanga na kuwela na ukomu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Ni handa amonga gha wayandika wa masaili wa mwenga wailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Twenga twa wana ghaki.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Kwaikiva twenga ni wana wa Sapanga, itupala ng'ogha kumwachila Sapanga yiwa handa zahabu, na feza au hata liganga lihongolilwi na kuvikwa umaheli na wandu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Sapanga kaghola handa vila angulola ng'ogha lipindi lila wandu wammanya ng'ogha ila mweni hinaa angulaghila wandu wogha kogha kogha waleki mahakata na kumuhyukila. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwaikiva kavika kala lichuwa ligha ateutosa mlima wogha kwa uchakaka kwa njila gha mundu mmonga amhaghulili. Sapanga awahighilisila wogha mghalu hau kwa kumhindula mundu hayu kuhuma ku kihu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Pawamyoghanilili Paulo angulonga kwa mghalu wa uhinduko, wamonga gha weni wakamheka, ila ghangi wailongile, “Tungupala tukuyoghanili kangi kwa mghalu hau.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Hinu, Paulo akawaleka, akahuka munjengakaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ila wandu wamonga wakamkovekela na wakayitikila kila akilongile, Wamonga gha weni wawelili Dionisio akiva ni mjumbi wa hila njengakaya, na mdala mmonga akemilwi Damalisi na wamonga ghangi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kula ku Kolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Payayomola hagha, Paulo akahuka ku Asene, akayenda kolintu <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kula Kolintu, amwonili Myahudi mmonga akemilwi Akula, muwelekwa wa Ponto. Akiva kahika lipindi litali ng'ogha kuhuma Italia pamonga na mdala ghaki wamkema Pilisila, kwa ikiva Kaisali Klaudio alaghilili Wayahudi wogha wahuki Loma. Paulo ayendili kuwatyangila, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na kwa vila weni wawelili wandu wa kusona mahema handa mweni, Paulo alikalili na weni akaghola lihengu lya kusona mahema. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila lichuwa lya kupumulila Paulo awelili akilongelana na weni kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi akiyesa kuwakwegha Wayahudi na Wagiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoseo pawahika kuhuma kumlima wa Mekidonia, Paulo atumbulili kutumila lipindi lyaki lyogha kwa kutangasa lilando lya Sapanga, akawahighilisila Wayahudi yiwa Yesu ndiwa Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Wayahudi pawamngingama na kumligha, akapundanga nguu zyaki kuulongolo ghao akilonga, “Pamyaghamila ni lihengu lya mweni, nenga nivile ng'ogha na masitaka, Na kuhuma hinaa nitewayendela wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Hinu, akahuka pala akayenda kulikala ukaya kwa mundu mmonga kawela ng'ogha Myahudi mkwinila Sapanga akemilwi Titusi Yusito, avile lighuta lyaki liwelili pabehi na lila lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo, mkulu wa lila lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi, akamyitikila Bambu mweni pamonga na walongu ghaki wogha. Wakolintu watangala wauyoghanilili ujumbi hula, wakaukwinila na kubatiswa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Lichuwa limonga uhiku, Bambu amlongilili Paulo kumawonu, “Ukotoho kutila, uyendi kutangasa habali zya Sapanga na ukotoho kunyamala, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />ikiva nenga niweli pamonga na wenga. Kwahela mundu ateyesa kukuvamila na kukuhakila kwaikiva wandu watangala kummbwani hau ni wandu wa nenga.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Hinu, Paulo akatama kula akivula lilando lya Sapanga paghati ghao kwa lipindi lya lichuva limonga na miehi isita.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ila lipindi Galio paawelili mkulu wammbwani wa Akaya, Wayahudi wampundangili Paulo kwa pamonga na kumyegha kulighuta lya kulamula. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Na kumsitaki wakilonga, “Mundu hayu anguwavula wandu kumyupa Sapanga kwa njila ipalilwi ng'ogha na laghililo lya twenga.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulo paapalili kulonga, Galio akawalongela Wayahudi, “Ikiva mngumlalamikila mundu hayu kwa lilando lya uhakata au uhakata mkulunga augholili, ningawayoghanila mwenga Wayahudi maheli. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ila kwaikiva ni lilando lya utatala wa milandu na mahina na laghililo lya mwenga, mlamule mwenga weni. Nenga niwesa ng'ogha kuwela mlamula wa mighalu hagha!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Hinu, akawawinga kuhuma mulighuta lya kulamula. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Na wala wogha wakamkamula Sositenesi yula awelili kilongosi wa lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi, wakamtova palapala kuulongolo gha lighuta lya kulamula. Ila mghalu hula umghasa ng'ogha Galio.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguhuya kangi Anitiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulo ayendelellili kutama na wala walongu kula Kolintu kwa machuwa yatangala. Hinu akawataula, akakwela whatu kuyenda Silia pamonga na Pilisila na Akula. Kula Kenikilea, Paulo akamoa hwila ghaki kwaikiva gha kutimilila kilapo kyaki avikili. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wahikili Efesu na pala Paulo awalekili Pilisila na Akula, akayenda kulighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi, akalongelana na wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Wamluwili atami na wala lipindi litali nesu, ila apalili ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Paawelili anguhuka, alongili, “Sapanga akipala nitehika kwa mwenga kangi.” Akahuka Efesu kwa whatu.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Na mweni paahikili kummbwani Kaisalia, Paulo akayenda Yelusalemu kujambusa konganiko lya wakilisito kula. Hinu akayenda Anitiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Atamili kula lipindi liyaghani, hinu akayendelela na mwanja kwa kupitila mmbwani wa Galatia na Fulugia akiwataya moyu wavulwa wogha.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo angutangasa Habali Maha ku Efesu na ku Kolintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ku machuwa ghala, Myahudi mmonga, lihina lyaki Apolo, muwelekwa wa mmbwani wa Alekisandilia, ahikili kummbwani Efesu. Awelili mundu mweni uweso wa kulongela na mweni kumanya nesu mayandiko. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Mundu hayu awelili kavulwa njila gha Bambu, na mweni atangasili kwa makakala nesu na kuvula kwa uchakaka Habali zya Yesu. Ila awelili akimanya hela ubatiso wa Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Pilisila na Akula pawamyoghanilili akilonga akiva na holu ng'ogha mghati gha lighuta lya kukonganika wayahudi, wakayenda na mweni ukaya kwa weni na kumvula njila gha Sapanga kwa uchakaka nesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Hinu Apolo akalamula kuyenda kumahala wapakema Akaya, wala walongu wa Efesu wamtayili moyu kwa kuwayandikila wavulwa kula mahala wapakema Akaya wampokeli. Paahikili kula, awelili mtanga nesu kwa wala wawelili wamkwinila Sapanga kwa ulungwana wa Sapanga, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kwaikiva kwa uweso mkulunga awangingamili Wayahudi kuluagha akihighilisa kwa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yiwa Yesu ndiwa Kilisito mkombola.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulo angutangasa haku Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Lipindi Apolo paawelili Kolintu, Paulo akayenda mwanja kumlima wa Efesu. Kula akawalola amonga wa wavulwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Paulo akakonya, “Ghuli, pamumkwinila Kilisito mpokelile Mpumulo wa Sapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Na weni wakamyanga, “Ng'ogha. Hata tuyoghanili ng'ogha yiwa kuvile na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Na mweni akalonga, “Hinaa mpokela ubatiso wa ghuli”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Wakamyanga, “Ubatiso wa Yohana”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Na mweni Paulo akalonga, “Ubatiso wa Yohanauwelili wa kulangiha yiwa wandu waleka mahakata na kumhyukila Sapanga. Yohanaawalongelili wandu wamyitikili yula avile awelili anguhika badili ghaki, akimkema ni Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pawayoghanila hagha, wabatisilwi kwa lihina lya Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Hinu, Paulo akawavikila mawoku kunani gha mutu ghao na Mpumulo wa Sapanga akawahulukila, wakatumbula kulonga luga hyonu na kulonga ghala Sapanga ateghola. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Wandu wogha wawelili pala wawelili walumi ikumi na waivili.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kwa lipindi lya miehi itatu Paulo awelili akityanga ku Lighuta lya kutundamila Wayahudi, akalongela na wandu kwa makakala na kughola malongelano na kuyesa kuwakwegha wandu ili wakwinili habali gha Unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ila wamonga wa wandu wawelili na mioyu mitatala hata wakalema kukwinila, wakatumbula kulighu ujumbi wa Paulo kuulongolo gha wandu wakonganikili. Kwa nagha Paulo akawaleka, akayenda na wavulwa weka ghao. Na kila lichuwa akasindana na wandu kukyumba kya mavulo kya mundu mmonga akemilwi Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ayendelili kughola nagha kwa lipindi lya machuva ivili hata wenikaya wogha wa Asia, na Wayahudi na wandu wa Wayahudi ng'ogha, wakawesa kuhyoghanila lilando lya Bambu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Sapanga agholili makangaso gha kukangasa kwa kupitila Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Wandu wawelili wakitola hata nguu zya kupukutila lihuki na nguu zya lihengu avile Paulo katumila, wakaziyegha kwa wavina, na weni wakalamiswa uvina ghao na wala wawelili na mahoka, mahoka yakawahuka. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayahudi wamonga weni kuwesa kuhumisa mahoka wayendili kogha na kogha wakilitumila lihina lya Yesu kuwalongela mahoka. Wawelili wakilonga, “Ninguwalaghila kwa lihina lya Yesu yula Paulo angumtangasa ninguwalongela yiwa mumuhuki mundu hayu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Kuwelili na wana walumi Isaba wa Sikewa, mtambika mkulu wa Kiyahudi, hagha wana wawelili wangughola handa wala Wayahudi weni kuwesa kuhumisa mahoka.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ila lichuwa limonga Lihoka likawayanga wala wana wa Sikewa kwa kukalipa, “Ningummanya Yesu yiwa ndiwa ampeghili Paulo makakala gha kuhumisa mahoka na Paulo mweni ningummanya, ila mwenga ni mkinaghani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Hinu yula mundu avile na mahoka akawajumbila wogha, akawasinda kwa makakala. Na wala wana wa Sikewa wakabhutuka mbilo kuhuma lila lighuta wakiva na nguu ng'ogha na weni vilonda. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kila mundu kula Efesu, Myahudi na avile ng'ogha Myahudi, wayoghanili mghalu hula, wogha wakayingilwa na holu, wakalikwilikila lihina lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wandu watangala wamkwinilili Yesu wahikili paluagha wakalongela mighalu mihakata waigholile na kumhyukila Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wandu watangala wawelili wakiva wakighola uhawi kuhuma dahile, wakungulili vihitabu ghao, wakavinyanya vyogha lyoto kuulongolo gha wogha. kipimilo kya mapesa gha vihitabu vinyanywili vyogha kiwelili kitangala nesu handa vipandi viihamsini ielufu vya lidini gha feza. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Kwa njila hai, lilando lya Bambu lilandalili nesu na kuvile na uweso nesu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makologhanyo ku Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Mighalu hila paiyomwiki kugholeka, Paulo akalamula kuyenda Yelusalemu kwa kupitila mimbwani gha Makidonia na Akaya kujambusa wavulwa. Akajilongela mweni mumoyu, “Panihika Yelusalemu niteyenda Ulumi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Na mweni, akawalaghila watumikila ghaki waivili wa kumtanga, Timoseo na Elasito ku Makidonia, na mweni akatama kwa machuwa mayaghani kula Asia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Lipindi lila ndiwa payahumili maghaso makulunga kula Efesu kwaikiva gha njila hila gha Bambu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kuwelili na mghola feza mmonga akemilwi Demetilio, awelili na lihengu lya kuhongola vilighuta vya kuhongola vinung'una nung'una vya mlungu mdala akemilwi Alitemi. Lihengu hali liwapeghili wahongola ghaki mapesa ngenju. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetilio akawakungula wala waghola lihengu pamonga na wamonga wawelili na lihengu handa hali, akawalongela, “Walongu, mngumanya yiwa tungupokela mapesa ngenju kwa lihengu hali. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Hinaa, mnguwesa kuhyoghanila na kulola weni mighalu Paulo anguyaghola baha ng'ogha Efesu hela na kangi ku Asia hyogha. Mweni awalongelili wandu milungu igholwa na wandu ni milungu ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Nagha itevile maha ng'ogha, kutevile na udadambala ku lihengu lya twenga itevile na lihina lihakata. Ng'ogha nagha hela, kangi mghalu hau unguwesa kughola lighuta lya Mlungu Alitemi litevile kindu kya kupughanywa. Kumwihu ukwilikihi wa hayu Atemi angutundamilwa na wandu wogha wa Asia pamonga na mlima wogha kuteyomwike.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pawayoghanili hagha, wahyomili nesu, wakatumbula kutova lilowi, “Mkulu ni Atemi wa Efesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kummbwani wogha kukavile na maghaso. Wakawakamula Gayo na Alisitako, wenikaya wa Makidonia, wakiva wayaki na paulo, wakayenda na weni, wakabhutuka mbilu na weni mbaka kuluagha gha kuhinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo apalili kuyingila kuulongolo gha lila lipinga lya wandu, ila wavulwa wakamkanisa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Wakulu wamonga wa kula Asia, wala wawelili waghanja ghaki Paulo, wakamyegha mundu kumkanila akotoho kuyingila kumahakata kwa kuyenda kuyingila mghati gha hula luagha gha kuhinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Lipindi lila, kila mundu awelili angulalama angulongela kwa kukalipa, ghangi hali na ghangi lila, mbaka hula mkongano ukakologhanyika. Wandu watangala wamanyili ng'ogha hata ni kwaikiva gha niki wakongini pala. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Kwa vila Wayahudi wamkukulili Alekisanda kuulongolo gha wandu, Wamonga ghao kukonganiko wakampegha njila gha kulonga hinu Alekisanda akawayinulila liwoko kuwalangihi wandu watami nuu. Kwaikiva apalili kujitetela mweni kuulongolo gha weni. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ila pawamanyili yiwa mweni ni Myahudi, wandu wogha wakatova lilowi kwa pamonga, “Mkulu ni Alitemi wa Efesu.” Wakayendelela kulonga nagha kwa saa ivili.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Hinu, Myandika wa mmbwani awesili kuwaghola watami nuu, akawalongela, “Wandu wa Efesu! Kila mundu angumanya yiwa mmbwani hau wa Efesu ni mgholokela wa lighuta lya Mlungu Alitemi na mgholokela wa hila hindu gha kuhongwa iguwili kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kwa hela mundu anguwesa kulema mighalu hagha. Nagha, mtami nuu, mkotoho kughola chochosi kwa kuloposela. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwayegha wandu hagha baha pamonga na wahija ng'ogha hindu gha mlighuta wala kumlighu mlungu wa twenga mdala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Hinu ikiva Demetilio na waghola lihengu ghaki wavile na masitaka kwa wandu hagha, njengakaya zya lipala na vilongosi watama pala hinu wanguwesa kusitakilana haku. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ila ikiva mvile na mghalu ghangi, muuyeghi ku njengakaya ghangi. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kwaikiva gha hagha yahumila lelo tunguwesa kusitakiwa kwaikiva gha mkologhanyo kwahela lilando tunguwesa kujitetela kwa hagha.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Paayomola kulonga ghala akawalongela wandu wahuki.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyenda kangi Makidonia na Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ghala maghaso gha Efesu payayomolili kala Paulo awakemili pamonga wala wavulwa, akawataya moyu. Hinu akawataula, akayenda mbaka Makidonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Apitili kumimbwani gha mlima hula akiwataya moyu wandu kwa milandu mitangala. Kangi akahika Ugiliki, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />na kutama kula kwa miehi itatu. Paawelili angujiyandala kuyenda Silia, amanyili yiwa Wayahudi wawelili na mghalu wa kumkoma mweni, nagha awonili ahuyi kwa kupitila Makidonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatilo, mwana wa Piliho, kuhuma Belea, ayendili pamonga na mweni, Kangi alongosanili na Alistaliko na Sekundo kuhuma Tesalonike, Gayo kuhuma Delibe, Timoseo na Tukilo na Tilofimo wa mmbwani wa Asia wayendili pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Hagha wandu watulongulelili wakayenda kutulindila ku Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Twenga, badili gha mhambu gha bumunda livile ng'ogha na ujejema, tukwelili whatu kuhuma Filipi na badili gha machuwa itatu tukahika kula Tiloa. Kula tutamili kwa lipindi lya machuwa isaba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwatyangila kangi wakwinila wa Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Lichuwa lya mtumbulo lya liwiki palumihi tukongine ili kulyegha bumunda lya Bambu. Kwa vila Paulo apalili kuhuka kilau ghaki, awatangasili wandu na kuyendelela kulonga na weni mbaka uhiku wa mandandu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kukyumba kya kunani, kuwelili na malimbamba ngenju yanguyaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mhongolo mmonga akemilwi Eutiko avile atamili kulilanga lipindi Paulo paavile anguyendelela kutangasa. Eutiko atumbulili kuwonja mayaghani na mwihu ghaki akawonja luwono mtopeu, akaguwa pahi kuhuma kyumba kya itatu kunani. Wamwonili kahova kala. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paulo akahuluka pahi, akamwonjela kifulifuli yula mhongolo kunani ghaki. Hinu akawalongela wandu wagholokili kumtindila, “Mkotoho kuwela na holu, hinaa mhongolo hayu ni mkomu.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Hinu akakwela kangi kunani kula ku kyumba kya itatu, akalyegha mulyo. Akayendelela kulonga kwa lipindi litali mbaka malawila, kumwihu akayenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Wala wandu wakayenda na yula mhongolo mbaka ukaya kwa mweni akiva ni ukomu, mioyu gha weni ikapumula.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyenda Mileto kuhuma Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Twenga tuliyingila mu whatu. Paulo kayingila ng'ogha kuyenda na twenga ku Aso, kwaikiva apalili kuyenda kwa uloposeli kwa maghulu kupitila ku njila mbaka kumbwani Aso. Twenga tuyingila mu whatu na kuyenda ku mlima Aso. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Patukongine na mweni Paulo kula Aso, akayingila mu whatu tukayenda pamonga na mweni mbaka Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kuhuma kula tukayendelela na mwanja tukahika ku Kio kilau ghaki. Lichuwa lya ivili, tulihika Samo na kilau ghaki kangi tukahika Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo awachilili na kalamula kuyendelela na mwanja kwa whatu kapitila ng'ogha Efesu, kwaikiva awelili na uloposeli gha kuhika Yelusalemu pambila gha mhambu wa Pendekosite handa inguwesekana.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwataula wagogolo wa Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kuhuma Mileto Paulo akalaghila ujumbi kwa wagogolo wa Efesu yiwa wakongini na mweni. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Wala wagogolo pawahikili kwa mweni akawalongela, “Mngumanya vila nilikalili na mwenga machuwa hyogha kuhuma lichuwa lila lya utumbulo panihikili ku Asia.” <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mngumanya vila nimtumikila Bambu kwa utundamilu, kwa masosi na mayeso kuhuma kwa mawachilo mahakata gha Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mngumanya yiwa nihyeta ng'ogha hata mayaghani kuwatangasila paluagha na mmighuta gha mwenga na kuwavula hyogha ghala yangaliwatanga mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Niwalongelili wogha Wayahudi, na vilavila wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha, wamhyukili Sapanga kwa kuleka mahakata na kumkwinila Bambu wa twenga Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Hinaa, mniyoghanili nenga, Mpumulo wa Sapanga angupala niyendi Yelusalemu na nenga nimanyile ng'ogha kyani kitenihumila kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Kila nikimanyile ni yiwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga angunihighilisila yiwa kummbwani mmonga kwa mmbwani ghangi akilonga yiwa vihungo na lung'ai vingunilindila kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ila nivalanga ng'ogha ukomu wa nenga yiwa ni wa maha kwa nenga, ipita kuyomola lila lihengu lya Bambu Yesu anipegheli.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nityangili paghati mwa mwenga wogha nikitangasa Unkosi wa Sapanga. Ila hinaa, ningumanya yiwa kwahela hata mmonga wa mwenga atenilola kangi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Kwa nagha ninguwalongela lelo hinaa lipalalipala, ikiva mundu kayaghamila yiwa nenga nahela uhakata gha mwahi gha mundu yeyosi. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwa ikiva nihyeta ng'ogha hata mayaghani kuwalongela vyogha Sapanga apalili kughola kwa mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mlikali mihu mwa weni na mgholokeli lila likongamano lya wakwinila livile Mpumulo wa Sapanga kawavika mwenga mvile wagholokela. Mlihungi likonganiko lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lila kalihemela kwa mwahi gha mwana ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ningumanya maheli nesu yiwa panihuka haku kuyetu, wandu wavula milandu gha uhwangi watehika kwa mwenga na watevile wakalipa na watewavamila handa ghalumwitu wa kumanyahi na watewela ng'ogha na luhungu na mwenga. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Kangi kulipinga lya mwenga lya wakwinila kutevile na wamonga watewapapusa wakwinila kwa kuwavula lilando lya ughwangi na wandu watewakwinila na watevile wavulwa wa weni. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nagha mkali mihu wogha mkumbwike yiwa kwa lipindi lya machuva itatu uhiku na pamuhi nitoka ng'ogha kuwapegha malaghililo kila mmonga wa mwenga kwa masosi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Hinaa ninguwaleka mwenga pahi gha ugholokela wa Sapanga na kwa lilando lya ulungwana ghaki, na weni unauweso wa kuwachenga na kuwawesesa mpokeli zila highili awavikilili mwenga pamonga na wandu wogha. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nenga mwenibaha, nivile ng'ogha na luhujulu lwa feza na zahabu na nguu zya maha zya mundu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mngumanya mwengabaha yiwa nigholili lihengu kwa mawoku ghangu ili mbati mapesa kwaikiva gha nenga na wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ku kila kindu nigholili, nilangiha kwa mwenga yiwa kughola lihengu kwa lihuki lya twenga weni ili tuwesi kuwatanga wala wajiwesa ng'ogha, na lipindi tungughola nagha mngumbuki milandu gha Bambu Yesu mweni vila ailongile, ‘Ni highili nesu kupegha kupiti kupokela’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulo paayomolili kulonga, akatundama manunguna pamonga na weni wogha akayupa. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wogha wakalila masosi nesu, na kumkumbata na kumnonela. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Mghalu augholile kuwavika kuunyengemala ni vila ailongile mtenilola ng'ogha kangi. Ndiwa wakayenda pamonga na mweni mbaka ku whatu.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyenda Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Patuyomola kutaulana kula Efesu, tukayingila muwhatu tukayenda mbaka ku Kosi. Kilau ghaki tukahika Lodesi, na kuhuma kula tukayenda Patala, <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Kula ku Patala tukonganili na whatu iwelili inguyenda kumbwani Foinike, hinu tukayingila, tukayenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Badili gha kuhika mahala pavile tuwesa kuilola Kupulo, Tupitili mbandu ghaki gha kusini na kuyendelela na mwanja mbaka tukahika kumbwani Foinike, kumlima Silia. Tukahika kumbwani Tilo. Whatu igholokili pala machuwa mayaghani, kwaikiva wawelili wanguhumisa mihigu gha wandu. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Kula tuwonili wavulwa, hinu tukayenda kulikala pamonga na weni machuwa isaba. Wala wavulwa wakilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga wakamlongela Paulo ukotoho kuyenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ila lipindi lya twenga paliyomwike kala, wala wogha pamonga na wadala na wana ghao wakayenda na twenga mbaka panji gha mmbwani. Patuhikili mmbali mwa bahali, wogha tukatundamila manung'una tukamyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Hinu, tukataulana wogha, twenga tukayingila muwhatu na weni wakahuya ukaya ghao.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Kuhuma Tilo, tukayendelela kwa kutumila whatu mbaka kumbwani Tolemai. Kuwelili na wavulwa kula, tukawajambusa na kulikala na weni kwa lichuwa limonga. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Kilau ghaki tukahuka tukayenda kummbwani Kaisalia. Kula tukayenda kulighuta lya mtangasa Filipo. Mweni avile mmonga wa wala isaba wawahaghulili kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Na mweni Filipo awelili na mabiti wanjechi wayingilwa ng'ogha na mlumi. Kila mmonga awesili kulonga yala Sapanga ateghola. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Badili gha kulikala haku machuwa mayaghani, mlota akemilwi Agabo kuhuma kummbwani Yudasia akahika. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Akahika kwa twenga, akatola ngoyi gha Paulo. Akajiwopa hila ngoyi kumawoku na maghulu ghaki na akalonga, “Mpumulo wa Sapanga angulonga, 'Vilongosi wa Wayahudi ku Yelusalemu watemkola mawoku na maghulu mundu mweni ngoyi hai na watewapegha kwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha mundu hayu handa muwopwa.' ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Patuyoghanila hagha, twenga na wala wandu ghangi wawelili pala tukamluwa nesu Paulo akotoho kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ila Paulo akayanga, “Kwa kyani mngulila masosi na kunitenyula moyu kwa kunilongela nikotoho kuyenda Yelusalemu? Ng'ogha kuwopwa hela, nenga nijiyandala kala hata kuhova ku Yelusalemu kwaikiva gha lihina lya Bambu Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Patulola yiwa kalema kukweghwa na twenga. Tukalonga, “Yambendeza Bambu Sapanga yagholeki”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Machuwa gha kulikala pala Kaisalia payayomwike, tukawopa mihighu, tukayendelela na mwanja mbaka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Wamonga wa wala wavulwa kuhuma mmbwani Kaisalia wayendili na twenga kula Yelusalemu, wakatuyegha kulighuta lya mundu akemilwi Mnasoni, mwenikaya wa Kupilo, awelili mkwinila wa Yesu kwa machuva matangala.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumtyangila Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Patuhikili ku Yelusalemu, lipinga lya walongu wamkwinila Kilisito wakatupokela kwa luheku nesu. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Kilau ghaki Paulo ayendili pamonga na twenga kumjambusa Yakobu. Na wagogolo wa wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wawelili pala hilahila. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paayomola kuwajambusa, Paulo akawalongela mighalu igholilwi kwa mundu mmonga mbaka ghangi Sapanga awelili kaghola paghati gha wandu wa Wayahudi ng'ogha kwa njila gha utumikila ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Pawayoghanila ghala, hinu wakamlongela Paulo, “Mlongu, ungujilolela mweni vila pavile na wandu imaelufu wa Kiyahudi hinaa wavile wakwinila wa Kilisito na wogha wangukola laghililo lya Musa kwa umaha. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Wayoghanilili yiwa unguvula Wayahudi wogha wala wangulikala kumlima wa Wayahudi ng'ogha na wakotoho kukovekela laghililo lya Musa ukiwavula wakotoho kuwayingisa jandu wana wa weni na kangi wakotoho kukovekela malaghililo gha Kiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ni uchakaka wandu wala watevile wayoghanila kala yiwa uhika, hinu hinaa tugholi kyani? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nagha ugholi handa havi tungukulongela. Tuvile na wandu wanjechi baha pamonga na twenga hagha wavile wajiwopa weni kwa kuilongela yiwa watempegha kindu Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Uyendi na wandu wala kumhambu ghao gha kujighulula na uhipi kwa kila wakitumila, hinu watemoa hwila ghao. Kwa njila hai wandu wogha watemanya yiwa mighalu hyogha wayoghanilili ni gha ughwangi, ila wenga ungukovekela laghililo lya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Kwa wala wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wakwinilili, tuwayandikilila lihamba gha kuwalongela yala wangupalwa kughola. Yiwa wakotoho kulyegha mulyo hula wandu wautolela litambiku kwa vindu vya kuhongwa, wakotoho kunywegha mwahi kuhuma kwa mkokolo, na wakotoho kulyegha mkokolo yula wandu wamhinja ng'ogha. Hilahila tuwalongela wakotoho kughola ungongola.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Na kilau ghaki akawatola wala wandu wanjechi pamonga na mweni wakaghola mhambu wa kujighulula. Kangi, Paulo akayenda ku lyugha lya lighuta lya Sapanga ili kuwalongela watambika yiwa ligha wateyomola kujighulula na ligha kila mmonga atetola litambiku.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angukamulwa mghati gha lighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Lipindi machuwa ghala isaba yakiva pabehi kuyomoka, wamonga wa Wayahudi kuhuma mbandu gha Asia wawelili wamwonili Paulo mghati gha Lighuta lya Sapanga. Wakalipapusa lipinga lya wandu wamkamuli Paulo, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />wakitova lilowi, “Wandu wa Izilaeli! Mtutangi, kunooo Hayu ndiwa yula mundu anguwavula wandu kogha na kogha wakingami malaghilo gha Musa na mahala baha pa Sapanga. Hinaa kawayingisa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha kulighuta lya Sapanga na kupaghola pavile maha ng'ogha mahala pa Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Walongili havi kwaikiva wawelili wamwonili Tilofimo, mwenikaya wa Efesu, akiva pamonga na Paulo kumbwani, wakawachila yiwa Paulo awelili kamyingisa mulighuta lya Sapanga.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Wandu kuhuma kogha na kogha wa kumbwani wayoghanilili yiwa kuvile na maghaso ku lyugha lya Lighuta lya Sapanga, wakabhutukila kula. Wakamkamula Paulo na kumkulughula panji gha lighuta lya Sapanga. Na bahala milyango gha lyugha lya lighuta lya Sapanga ikawopwa kwa kuloposela. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Lipindi wandu wala wangupala kumkoma Paulo lilando likamuhikila mkulu wa Watovangondo kuhuma Loma yiwa mlima wogha wa Yelusalemu umema mkologhanyiko. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Mkulu wa watovangondo, bwitu akatola wakulu ghangi na lipinga likulunga lya watovangondo wakabhutukila kumkologhanyiko. Lipinga lya wandu pawamlola yula mkulu wa watovangondo na wala watovangondo wanguhika hinu wakaleka kumtova Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu wa watovangondo akamuyendela Paulo, akamkamula na kulaghila awopwe kwa minyololu miivili. “Akakonya yiwa mweni ni ghani na awelili kaghola kyani.” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wamonga wa wandu kulila lipinga wawelili wakitova lilowi, wakilonga nagha na ghangi wakilonga vila. Yula mkulu wa watovangondo paalolili yiwa awesi ngʼogha kuhyoghanila uchakaka wa mghalu hula kwaikiva gha mkologhanyiko, akalaghila Paulo ayeghwi kungomi gha watovangondo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulo paahikili kungasi, watovangondo wakampapa kwaikiva gha makalaghanyo gha wandu wala wamkovekela. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Lila lipinga lya wandu wawelili wakimkovekela kunu wakiyendelela kutova lilowi, “akomwi hayu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulitetela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Wala watovangondo pawawelili wakimyingisa kungomi ghao, Paulo akamluwa mkulu wa watovangondo akilonga, “Ninguwesa kukulongela kindu?” Yula mkulu wa wagholokela akamyanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">“Ghuli, ungumanya Kigiliki wenga”? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Ghuli, wenga ng'ogha yula Mmisili avile machuwa hagha pabehi atumbulisili mkologhanyo ili kuipingika Silikali na ukalongosa lipinga lya wandu wahakata wakoma wandu ielufu njechi wavile na migoha mbaka kuluvagha?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo akamyanga, “Nenga ni Myahudi, muwelekwa wa Taliso ku Kilikia; nenga ni mwenikaya wa mbwani mkulunga. Pepayi, unilekiseli nilonge na hagha wandu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Yula mkulu wa watovangondo akamleka alonge na wandu. Paulo akagholoka ku ngasi akatumbula kwa kuwapungila liwoko wala wenikaya ili walikali jii, na wogha pawalikala jii, Paulo akalongela na weni kwa luga gha Kiebulania akilonga:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Walongu wa nenga na watati ghangu, mniyoghanili hinaa nikijitetela kuulongolo gha mwenga.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pawayoghanila akilonga na weni kwa Kiebulania wakayendelela kutama nuu nesu kupiti mtumbulo. Na mweni Paulo akayendelela kulonga,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Nenga ni Myahudi, muwelekwa wa kumbwani Taliso ku Kilikia. Ila nileleliwi baha kumbwani Yelusalemu pahi gha mvula Gamalieli. Nivulilwi kukovekela kwa umaha malaghililo gha wagogolo wa twenga. Kwa umaha nikwinilili malaghilo hyogha, kwa ikiva nipalili kumyitikila Sapanga handa mwenga mvile hinaa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Niwahakili na hata kuwakoma wala wandu wakovekelili mavulo gha Yesu. Niwakamulili walumi na wadala na kuwavika mulighuta lya wawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mtambika Mkulu na njengakaya hyogha gha wagogolo wanguwesa kuhighilisa yiwa ni uchakaka vila nilongela. Kuhuma kwa weni wanipeghili lihamba iyandikilwi kwa wala walongu Wayahudi wavile kula Damesiki. Niyendili Damasiko ili niwakamuli wandu wakovikela mavulo gha Yesu na kuwayegha handa wawopwa mbaka Yelusalemu ili wahakilwi.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulongela vila kalokoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Matendu 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">Matendu 26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Hinu, panivile kunjila pabehi na kuhika kumbwani Damasiki, lipindi lya lisaa isita pamuhi, mhana mkulunga kuhuma kundumba bwitu ukanihumila na ukanilangasila pandi zyogha.” <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Baha nikaguwa pahi, nikayoghanila lilowi likinilongela, “Sauli, Sauli! Kwa kyani ungunihakila?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Na nenga nikakonya, “wenga ni ghani, Bambu?” Na mweni akanilongela, “Nenga ni Yesu wa Nazaleti yula wenga ungunihakila.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Hinu, wala wandu wavile pamonga na nenga, waulolili hula mhana ila wamanya ng'ogha lilowi lya yula awelili akilongela na nenga. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Hinu, nenga nikakonya, “Nigholi kyani Bambu?” Na mweni Bambu akanilongela, “Gholoka, uyendi Damasiko na kula utelongelwa hyogha ungupalwa kughola.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Paniwela niwesa ng'ogha kulola kwaikiva gha kung'ala kwa hula mhana wala wayangu wakanikola liwoku mbaka Damasiko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Kula kuwelili na mundu mmonga akemilwi Anania, mundu myupa Sapanga, mweni kukwinila malaghilo gha twenga na mweni kutundamilwa nesu kuulongolo gha Wayahudi wawelili wangulikala Damesiki.” <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Mweni akagholoka pabehi na nenga, akalonga, “Mlongu Saulo! Lola kangi.” Palapala nikalola kangi, nikamlola Anania. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Hinu Anania akalonga, “Sapanga wa mbuyi wa twenga kakuhaghula wenga ili upati kumanya mapalo ghaki na kumlola yula mtumikila ghaki wa maha na kumyoghanila lilowi lyaki mweni akilonga.” <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwaikiva utevile mlongela ghaki kwa yala uyalolili na kuhyoghanila. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Hinaa ungulindila kyani? “Gholoka na ubatiswi na kuhumisiwa mahakata ghako kwa kulikema lihina lyaki.”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angukemwa kuwatangasila wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Panihika Yelusalemu, na panivile nikiyupa ku Lighuta lya Sapanga, nikapokela mawonu. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Nikamlola Bambu akinilongela, ‘Uhuki Yelusalemu kwa uloposeli kwaikiva wandu wa baha watejumila ng'ogha yala uyalolile yala yanilongile nenga.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Na nenga nikamyanga, ‘Bambu,’ weni wangumanya chakaka yiwa nenga ni yula avile angutyangatyanga kumighuta gha kutundamila Wayahudi na kuwakamula na kuwatova wala wavile wangukukwinila wenga. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />‘Na lipindi mtumikila ghako Sitefano akihova, nenga mwenibaha niwelili pala nikayitikilana na mghalu hula na kugholokela makoti gha wala wawelili wangumkoma.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Na mweni Bambu akanilongela, ‘Uyendi, nitekuyegha kutali kwa wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Wala wandu wawelili wangumyoghanila Paulo mbaka pala kayomola kulonga lilando lya mwihu ndiwa wakatova lilowi wakilonga, “Mumkomi hayu! Mundu hayu kapalwa ng'ogha kuyendelela kulama.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Wayendelili kutova lilowi mkomi hayu na wakipungila makoti ghao na kutagha lifu kunani kuwonesa vila wahyomili. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkulu wa watovangondo awalaghilili wagholokela ghaki wamyeghi Paulo mghati gha ngomi, akawalongela wamtove hyatu Paulo ili awalongeli kwa kyani Wayahudi wangutova lilowi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ila pawayomola kumuwopa kwa ngoi zya ngosi ili wamtove hyatu, Paulo akamlongela kilongosi wa wagholokela avile kagholoka pala pabehi na mweni, “Ghuli hagha gha maha mwenga kumtova hyatu mundu kuhuma ku Lumi handa mwenga ikiva kambila kulamulwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yula kilongosi pakahyoghanila hila milandu akamyendela Mkulu wa watovangondo akilonga, “Ungupala kughola kyani? Kwa ikiva mundu hayu ni mundu wa mlima wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Hinu, Mkulu wa watovangondo akamyendela Paulo, akamkonya, “Ghuli, wenga ni mundu wa mlima wa Loma?” Paulo akamyanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Yiiina.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mkulu wa watovangondo akalonga, “Nenga nivile mundu wa mlima wa Loma kwa kuhipa mapesa ngenju.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulo akalonga, “Ila nenga ni mundu wa mlima wa Loma kwa kuwelekwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wala wandu wawelili wakilindila kumkonya Paulo wakahuka bwitu. Hata yula Mkulu wa watovangondo akatila paamanyili yiwa Paulo ni mundu wa Loma na vila kamwopisa kala minyololu.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulitetela kuulongolo gha njengakaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Kilau ghaki, Mkulu wa watovangondo apalili kumanya mahakata hyogha Wayahudi wawelili wangumsitakila Paulo. Nagha, akamuwopola, akalaghila Watambika Wakulu na njengakaya hyogha wakongine. Hinu akamyegha Paulo, akamgholokesa kuulongolo gha njengakaya.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo akaitumbulila mihu hila njengakaya, hinu akatumbula kulonga, “Walongu ghangu, mbaka lelu lukani lwa nenga ni kupala kuyendelela kughola maha kuulongolo gha Sapanga.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Pala Mtambika Mkulu Anania akawalaghila wala wawelili wagholoka pabehi na Paulo wamtovi mbandi ku mlomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Hinu, Paulo akamlongela, “Sapanga mwenibaha atekutova wenga ni mmbindingu! inguwesekana ghuli kulikala haku ili unilamuli kilaghililo na kunu ungutenyula lilaghililo kwa kulaghila wanitovi?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wandu wawelili wagholoka pala wakamlongela Paulo, “Ungumlighu Mtambika Mkulu wa Sapanga!” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo akayanga, “Walongu ghangu, nimanyili ng'ogha yiwa mweni ni Mtambika Mkulu. Kwaikiva mayandiko yangulonga, ‘Ukotoho kulongela uhakata kwa kilongosi wa wandu ghako.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulo paamanyili yiwa mbandu monga munjengakaya ni Masadukayu na ghangi ni Mafalisayo. Hinu akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga kuulongolo gha njengakaya, “Walongu ghangu, nenga ni Mfalisayo, tati ghangu ni Mfalisayo. Nenga niyeghilwi mulighuta lya kulamula kulamulwa kwaikiva ningukwinila wahovili watehinduka.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Paayomola kulonga milando hila, pakahumila mkologhanyiko paghati gha Mafalisayo na Masadukayu na ila njengakaya ngulu ikalekanila mbandu ivili. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Hagha yahumila kwaikiva, Masadukayu ukwinila yiwa wahovili wahinduka ng'ogha, kwahela Watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, na kwahela hilahila mpumulo. Ila Mafalisayo ukwinila hyogha maitatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Lilowi likayendelela na wamonga wa wavula wa malaghilo wa lipinga lya Mafalisayo wakagholoka na kulonga kwa makakala, “Tulola ng'ogha chochosi kivile kihakata kwa mundu hayu, inguwesekana yiwa mpumulo au mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga alongelili na mweni.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Mkalaghanyiko ukayendelela na kuvile mtopehu hata mkulu wa watovangondo akatila yiwa Paulo angelakatuliwa vipandivipandi. Kwa nagha, akawalaghila watovangondo ghaki kuyingila paghati gha lila lipinga lya Wayahudi, wamhumisi Paulo na kumhuyisa mghati gha ngomi gha watovangondo. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Uhiku wa lichuwa lila, Bambu akamuhumila Paulo akigholoka pabehi na mweni, akamlongela, “Jipeghi moyu! handa havi ungunihighilisa baha Yelusalemu, uteghola hilahila kumbwani Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wangupala kumkoma Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Malawila pee, Wayahudi wamonga wagholili mkongano wa kuhigha. Wakavika kilapo, Tukotoho kulyegha wala kunywegha mbaka pala tutepomkoma Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wala wagholili mghalu hula wawelili wandu wapiti ialobaini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Hinu, wakayenda kwa Watambika Wakulu na wagogolo, wakalonga, “Twenga tuvika kilapo yiwa tukotoho kulyegha au kunywegha chochosi mbaka tumkoma Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Hinaa, mwenga pamonga na njengakaya muyeghi lilaghililo kumluwa mkulu wa watovangondo ili amyeghi Paulo kwa mwenga mjigholi yiwa mngupala kumkonya Paulo mpati habali zyaki kwa utali. Na twenga tutemlindila munjila na kumkoma Paulo pambila gha kuhika baha.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ila mwipa ghaki Paulo paayoghanili mghalu hau mhakata, akayenda kula kungomi gha watovangondo na kumlongela Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Hinu Paulo akamkema mmonga wa mgholokela wa watovangondo, akamlongela, “Myeghi msongolo hayu kwa mkulu wa watovangondo, kana kindu kya kumlongela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yula mgholokela wa watovangondo akamyegha hayu msongolo, akamlongosa mbaka kwa mkulu wa watovangondo, akalonga, “Yula mwopwa Paulo anikemili akaniluwa nimyeghi msongolo hayu kwa wenga kana mghalu wa kukulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkulu wa watovangondo akamkola hayu msongolo liwoku, akayenda na mweni mahala pa kuhigha, akamkonya, “Uvile na kyani kya kunilongela?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yula msongolo akalonga, “Wayahudi wajumilana wakuluwi umyeghi Paulo kilau mu Njengakaya na weni watejighola wangupala kumkonya kwa utali ghala masitaka ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ila wenga ukotoho kuwajumila kwa ikiva kuvile na wandu wapiti ialobaini wangumnyatila wamkomi. Walilapila wakotoho kulyegha au kunywegha kindu chochosi mbaka wamkomi Paulo. Hinaa wajiyandala kala na wangulindila ulamula ghako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu wa watovangondo akamkanisa akotoho kumlongela mundu yoyosi yiwa amlongilile mghalu hula. Hinu akamleka yula msongolo ayendi zyaki.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyeghwa kwa kilongosi Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Hinu, mkulu wa watovangondo akawakema wagholokela waivili wa watovangondo akawalongela, “Muyandali watovangondo imia ivili, wakwela Falasi isabini na watovangondo imia ivili wa mifighu, wayendi ku Kaisalia, na mvile mliyandala kuhuka pambila gha isaa itatu lelo uhiku. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Myandali Falasi waghangi kwa Paulo na atewatumila kwa mwanja, mumyeghi kwa umaha kwa Felikisi, mkulu wa kumbwani.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Hinu, kuulongolo hayu mkulu wa watovangondo akayandika lihamba kwa Felikisi havi,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kwa mtundamilwa kilongosi Felikisi ningukujambusa nenga Kilaudio Lusia. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Wayahudi wamkamulili mundu hayu na pabehi kumkoma ndiwa nikayenda pamonga na watovangondo nikamkombola panipokela habali yiwa mweni ni mundu wa mlima wa Loma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nimyeghili kuulongolo gha njengakaya lyao Wayahudi ngulu nipalili kumanya yala masitaka ghao wamsitakila. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nikalola yiwa wangumsitaki kwa mighalu gha malaghilo ghao na nagha niwonili ng'ogha yiwa agholili chochosi kimpala ahovi au kuwopwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Panilongelwa yiwa Wayahudi wawelili wavika mghalu wa kumkoma, nilamulili kumyegha kwa wenga, nikawalongela wayeghi masitaka ghao kwa wenga.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Hinu, wala watovangondo wamtolili Paulo handa walaghililwi, wakamyegha uhiku hula hula mbaka kumbwani Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Kilau ghaki watovangondo wanguyenda kwa maghulu wakahuya kungomi, wakawaleka wala watovangondo wakwela falasi wayendeleli na mwanja pamonga na Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pawahikili kumbwani Kaisalia wampeghili yula kilongosi wa kumbwani hula lihamba na kumvika Paulo kuugholokela ghaki. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felikisi paaisomili hila lihamba akawakonya watovangondo yiwa, “Hayu Paulo anguhuma mahala kugha? Paamanyili yiwa anguhuma kumbwani Kilikia,” <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />akalonga, “Niteyoghanila masitaka ghako pawahika wala wasitaka ghako.” Hinu akapala Paulo avikwi pahi gha ugholokela mghati gha lighuta lya ulongosi wa nkosi Helodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wangumsitaki Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Kuulongolo gha machuwa mhano, Mtambika Mkulu Anania akahika kumbwani Kaisalia pamonga na wagogolo ghangi na mvula avile mghalambula wa malaghililo mmonga akemilwi Telitulo, wakayenda kwa yula kilongosi wa kubwani Felikisi wakamlongela masitaka ghao ghala wangumsitaki Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulo paakemilwi ayingili mghati, Telitulo akatumbula kugubutula masitaka akilonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Mtundamilwa Felikisi, ulongosi ghako wa maheli uyeghili luheku likulunga na kughola wandu wakovekeli yala yavile maha. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tungupegha ushukwile utangala kwa wenga mahala kokosi na kwa njila yeyosi hila. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ila, nipala ng'ogha kukughola utoki, tungukuluwa kwa ulungwana ghako uyoghanile habali zyetu kwa uhupi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tumanyili yiwa mundu hayu ni mkalakala. Mweni hutumbulisa maghaso paghati gha Wayahudi kila mahala mlima wogha na kangi ni kilongosi wa kila kipinga kya Wanazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kangi apalili kulighola Lighuta lya Sapanga livile ng'ogha handa Sapanga wa twenga angupala liweli, na twenga tukamkamula. Tupalili kumlamula kwa laghililo lya twenga. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ila Lusia, mkulu wa watovangondo, akahika na watovangondo ghaki, akamtola kwa makakala kuhuma kwa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ikiva wenga mweni utemkonya konya mundu hayu utewesa kuipatila habali gha mighalu hila hyogha tungumsitaki.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Na weni Wayahudi wakajumila wakihighilisa yiwa masitaka hyogha wangumsitaki ni chakaka.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angujitetela kuulongolo gha Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Hinu, kilongosi wa kumbwani Felikisi akamlangiha Paulo kwa kilangihi kya kyala ili atumbuli kujitetela na mweni akayanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Nenga ninguhekelela kulitetela kuulongolo ghako bambu nikimanya yiwa uwelili mlamula wa mlima hau kwa machuva matangala.” <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Unguwesa kuhighilisa kwa uyuyuhu yiwa yapitile ng'ogha machuwa ikumi na ivili kuhuma paniyendili kuyupa kumbwani Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayahudi waniwonili ng'ogha nikilongelana na mundu yoyosi. Waniwonili ng'ogha nikipapusa wandu mulighuta lya Sapanga, na ng'ogha ku lighuta lya kutundamilila Wayahudi, ng'ogha mahala ghangi kokosi kummbwani hau. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Na kangi watewesa ng'ogha kuhighilisa masitaka hagha wangunisitakila yiwa ni chakaka. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ila ningujumila kuulongolo gha wenga yiwa ningumtumikila Sapanga wa mambuyi wa twenga nikikovekela njila hila weni wanguikema ni gha ughwangi. Ila kangi ninguyitikilana na mighalu hyogha yayandikilwi kuvihitabu vya laghililo na Walota. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Na nenga ninguikwinilila Sapanga, na weni wavile na ukwinila hau hau, yiwa wandu wa maha na wahakata watehinduka. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Kwa nagha ningughola vila ingupalwa kulikala kogha nilikala kwa umaha kuulongolo gha Sapanga na kuulongolo gha wandu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Hinu kwa vila niwela ng'ogha baha kwa machuva yatangala nihikili ku Yelusalemu ili kuwayeghela wayangu wa mlima ghangu mtanga na litambiku. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Lipindi paniwela nikighola hagha ndiwa wakanilola mulighuta lya Sapanga, niwelili nijighulula kala na niwelili ng'ogha na lipinga lya wandu hata maghaso. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ila kuwelili na Wayahudi ghangi kuhuma kumlima Asia, weni ndiwa wapalilwi kuhika baha kuulongolo ghako na kutola masitaka ghao handa nivile na chochosi kya kunisitaki. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Au, waleki hagha wandu wavile baha walonge uhakata waulolili kwa nenga panigholoka kuulongolo gha njengakaya lyao ngulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ila milandu hai weka niilongile paniwela kunjengakaya ghao ngulu, ‘Mngunilamula lelo kwaikiva ningukwinila yiwa wahovili watehinduka.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felikisi mweni baha alekili kughola chochosi kwaikiva amanyili habali zya Njila hila kwa umaha nesu, akalonga, “Lisia Mkulu wa watovangondo paahika haku nitelamula masitaka gha mwenga.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Hinu Felikisi akamlaghila yula mtovangondo amviki pahi gha ugholokela Paulo ila akotoho kumwopa na minyololu, na uwaleki waghanja ghaki Paulo wawesi kumlola na kumtanga chochosi angukipala.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulitetela kuulongolo gha Felikisi na Dulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Machuwa mayaghani kuulongolo, Felikisi akahika pamonga na mdala ghaki wamkema Dulusila, mweni awelili Myahudi, akalaghila Paulo ayeghwi, na Felikisi akahyoghanila Paulo akilonga habali zya kumkwinila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ila Paulo paatumbulili kulongela mighalu gha Kughola kwa ubaghula ng'ogha na kangi kuwela na uweso wa kujikanila mweni kupala hindu na vilavila lichuwa lya Sapanga kulamula wandu wogha palihika, Felisi akatila, akalonga uleki huti, “Nitekukema kangi kwa hinaa unguwesa kuyenda.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Lipindi lilalila Felikisi awelili anguwachila yiwa Paulo angempegha swinda. Hinu akawela akimkema mkema lipindi lyogha akilongela na mweni.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Payapitile machuva maivili, Polikio Fesito akampokela Felikisi alongose mweni. Felikisi akipala kuwahekelesa Wayahudi akamleka Paulo kuuwopwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguluwa akayoghanilwi kwa Kaisali nkosi mkulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Machuwa maitatu badili gha Fesitusi paahika Kaisalia kutola lihengu lyaki hyonu, akayenda mbaka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Haku Watambika wakulu na vilongosi wa Wayahudi wahikili kuulongolo ngaki Fesitusi na wakamsitaki Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Wakamluwa nesu Fesitusi, awagholeli ulungwana kwa kumyegha Paulo Yelusalemu, kwaikiva wavikili njila gha kumnyatila ili wamkomi kumnjila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ila Fesitusi akayanga, “Paulo atehighala muuwopwa ku Kaisalia na nenga niteyenda haku machuwa mayaghani kuulongolo. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Muwaleki vilongosi wa mwenga wayendi haku Kaisalia pamonga na nenga wakamsitaki ikiva mundu hayu kaghola mahakata.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesitusi atamili na weni Yelusalemu kwa machuwa inane au ikumi, na kuulongolo akahuya Kaisalia. Kilau ghaki akayenda munjengakaya, akalaghila Paulo ayeghwi mghati. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulo paahikili, Wayahudi wala wahumili ku Yelusalemu wakamtindila na kutumbula kumsitaki kwa kulongela mahakata ghaki matangala matopehu yakiva wanguwesa ng'ogha kuyahighilisa. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulo ajitetela kwa kulonga, “Nenga nighola ng'ogha uhakata wowosi kwa malaghilo gha Wayahudi, ng'ogha kwa Lighuta lya Sapanga, ng'ogha kwa Kaisali nkosi mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fesitusi apalili kuwahekelesa vilongosi wa Wayahudi na nagha akamkonya Paulo, “Ghuli ungupala kuyenda Yelusalemu na kula ukalamulwe kuulongolo gha nenga kwa masitaka hagha?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo akayanga, “Nigholoka kuulongolo gha mlamula laghililo wa Kaisali, na bahabaha ndiwa ningupalwa kulamulwa handa ungumanya maha yiwa niwagholela ng'ogha Wayahudi mahakata. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Hinu, ikiva nigholili uhakata au nighola mghalu ungunipala kukomwa, nenga nilema ng'ogha kuhova. Ila ikiva kwahela uchakaka wowosi kumasitaka ghao kwa nenga, kwahela mundu anguwesa kuniyegha kwa weni hinu niteluwa nikalamulwe kwa Kaisali nkosi mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Hinu Fesitusi paayomola kulonga na wandundami ghaki, akamlongela Paulo, “Unguluwa ukalamulwe kwa Kaisali nkosi wa Loma hinu uteyenda kwa Kaisali!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kuulongolo gha nkosi Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Machuwa mayaghani kuulongolo, Nkosi Agilipa na Belinike wahikili Kaisalia ili kumpegha utundamilu ghaki Fesitusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Wawelili kula machuwa mayaghani na mweni Fesitusi akamlongela Nkosi masitaka gha Paulo, “Kuvile na mundu mmonga baha yula avile Felikisi amlekili muuwopwa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Paniyendili Yelusalemu watambika wakulu na wagogolo wa Wayahudi wamsitakili na kuniluwa nimlamuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ila nenga nikawayanga yiwa haku kulikala ng'ogha kwa Waloma kumvika mundu ahakilwi pambila msitakiwa kakongine ng'ogha na wasitaki ghaki wuso kwa wuso na kulitetela yiwa kaghola mahakata au ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Hinu, pawahikili baha, nenga niyaghamisa ng'ogha lisaa ila nigholile mkongano na kilau ghaki, nikalaghila mundu hayu ayeghwi. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Na weni wasitaki ghaki pawagholokili, wamsitakili ng'ogha lilando lolosi lihakata handa niliwachilili. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ila wawelili na masindano gha kumkonya milandu gha dini gha weni na habali zya mundu mmonga wamkema Yesu, awelili kahova kala na mweni Paulo ailongile yiwa mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Nimanyili ng'ogha lya kughola kwa mghalu hula. Hinu, nimkonyili Paulo yiwa angupala kuyenda kula Yelusalemu na kulamulwa kula kwa mighalu hai. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ila Paulo akaluwa ayendeleli kulikala muuwopwa mbaka alamulwi bahala, hinu nilamulili alikali muuwopwa mbaka paniwesa kumyegha kwa Kaisali nkosi wa Loma.<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Hinu, Agilipa akamlongela Fesitusi, “Ningalipala kumyoghanila mundu hayu nenga mwenibaha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fesitusi akamlongela, “Utemyoghanila kilau.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Hinu, kilau ghaki, Agilipa na Belinike wahikili kwa luheku kulyugha lya mkongamano wakilongolana na wakulu wa watovangondo na vilongosi wa mmbwani. Fesitusi akalaghila Paulo ayeghwi mghati gha lyugha, <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitusi akalonga, “Nkosi Agilipa na wogha mvile baha pamonga na twenga! Baha kuulongolo gha twenga kuvile na mundu avile Wayahudi wogha baha na kula Yelusalemu waning'ung'unikilila na kutova lilowi yiwa angupalwa ng'ogha kulama kangi. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ila nenga nilolili ng'ogha yiwa awelili kaghola chochosi kihakata hata apalwi kuhova. Ila, kwaikiva Paulo mwenibaha aluwili kulamulwa na Kaisali nkosi wa Loma, nikalamula kumyegha ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Nenga nahela habali gha uchakaka ivile ninguwesa kumuyandikila mtundamilwa Kaisali Nkosi wa Loma kumlongelela Paulo. Hinu nipala kumyegha kuulongolo gha mwenga wogha mumyoghanile mweni akilonga nesu nesu kwa wenga Nkosi Agilipa ili paumkonya kumwihu niwesi kuyandika kindu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwaikiva ninguwachila itevile maha ng'ogha kumyegha muuwopwa ikiva nilangigha ng'ogha lipala masitaka ghaki.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulo angujitetela kuulongolo gha nkosi Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Hinu, nkosi Agilipa akamlongela Paulo, “Hinaa unguwesa kulitetela” ndiwa Paulo akalangigha liwoko na kutumbula kulitetela, akilonga,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Nkosi Agilipa, ningujilola mundu avile na manemu lelo kulitetela kuulongolo gha wenga kumighalu hyogha nisitakilwi na Wayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kangi kwa vila wenga mwenibaha ungumanya maha nesu mighalu gha dahile gha Wayahudi na mabisano ghao, ningukuluwa uniyoghanili kwa kunivumilila.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayahudi wangumanya habali zya kulama kwa nenga kuhuma uwana, vila nilikala kuhuma mtumbulo kumlima ghangu na haku Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wangunimanya kwa machuva ngenju, na wanguwesa kulongela, ikiva wangupala, kwaikiva kuhuma dahile nilikalili handa mmonga wa kipinga kya wandu wangujitola nesu kukovekela malaghililo gha Sapanga mudini gha twenga, hinu nitamili handa Mfalisayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Hinaa nivile baha nilamulwe kwaikiva ninguyitikila lila lilaghano Sapanga awalaghilili watati wa twenga. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Hali ndiwa lilaghano livile makabila gha twenga ikumi na ivili wanguwachila kulipokela kwa kumtumikila Sapanga kwa makakala uhiku na pamuhi Ee Nkosi na mghalu hau ndiwa ungunighola lelo nilamulwe na wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kwa kyani mwenga mnguyitikila ng'ogha yiwa Sapanga anguwesa kuwahindula wandu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Kwa chakaka nenga mwenibaha nikweghilwi kughola mighalu ngenju kulikingama lihina lya Yesu wa Nazaleti.” <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mighalu hagha ndiwa niigholili kula Yelusalemu. Nenga mwenibaha, nipeghilwi uweso kuhuma kwa watambika wakulu, na nikawavika mulighuta lya wawopwa wandu watangala wa Sapanga. Na lipindi pawalamulwa wahovi nenga niyitikilili yiwa wangupalwa wahovi. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Miyanja itangala niwagholili watovwe kumalighuta gha kutundamila Wayahudi hyogha nikiwaghola kwa makakala waleki kukwinila. Lilaka ghangu kwa weni liwelili likulunga hata nikawahakula mbaka mimbwani gha kutali.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwalongela vila kamkwinila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Matendu 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:12-18">Matendu 22:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Lichuwa limonga paniwelili kuimonga gha miyanja hila nikiva ninguyenda Damasiki, nikiva nipeghwa uweso na laghilo kuhuma kwa mtambika mkulu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mkulu Nkosi, lipindi paniwelili munjila, lisaa isita pamuhi, nilolili mhana mkulunga upitile wa lijuwa ukilangasa kuhuma kundumba, ukanitindila nenga na wala wayangu wawelili mumwanja na nenga. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Twenga wogha tukagua pahi, na nenga nikayoghanila lilowi likinilongela kwa Kiebulania, “Sauli, Sauli! Kwa kyani ungunihakila? Ni yuyughu ng'ogha kuutova mhomu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Nenga nikakonya, “Ni ghani wenga Bambu?” Namweni Bambu akayanga, “Nenga ni Yesu avile wenga ungunihakila.” <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Hata nagha, hinaa uyinuki, gholoka kwa maghulu ghako. Kwaikiva nikuhumila lukani, nikuvike utumikile kulongela mighalu ivile uyalola na ghala nitekuwonesa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nitekulokola na wandu wa Izilaeli na wandu Wayahudi ng'ogha wala nenga ningukuyegha kwa weni, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />“Utewamanyisa na kuwawesesa wahuki kulwiha na kuyingila kumhana, wahuki kuulongosi wa Lihyukana na wamhyukile Sapanga, ili kwa kuniyitikila, wawesi kulekeselwa mahakata na kupokela ulihi paghati gha wala Sapanga kawahaghula.”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angulongela habali gha utumikila ghaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Hinu, Nkosi Agilipa, niwesili ng'ogha kuleka kuyaghola yala mawonu Sapanga kanilolesa kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ndiwa nitumbulili kutangasa kwa kutumbula na wandu wa Damasiko, na kangi kwa wala wa Yelusalemu na mmbwani wogha wa Yudasia, na kangi kwa Wayahudi ng'ogha. Niwalongelili yiwa wangupalwa wamuhyukile Sapanga na kuwonesa kwa matendu yiwa waghalambula kala mioyu ghao. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwaikiva gha hagha, Wayahudi wakanikamula panivile mu Lighuta lya Sapanga na wakayesa kunikoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ila Sapanga anitangili na nagha mbaka lelu nigholoka kwa makakala nikilongela vila nilolili kwa wogha, wakulu na wanung'una. Ningulongela ni yala yavile walota wa Sapanga na Musa walongili yatehumila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />yiwa impalili Kilisito ahakilwi na kuwela wa mtumbula kuhinduka kuhuma kukihu, ili atangasi yiwa hinaa mhana wa ukombola unguwalangasila wandu wogha, Wayahudi na Wayahudi ng'ogha.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulo paakiyendelela kuitetela, Fesitusi akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Paulo, wenga uvile na lukwali! Kusoma kwa wenga kutangala kungukutaya ulukwali!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ila Paulo akalonga, “Mtundamilwa Fesitusi nivile ng'ogha na lukwali. Kila ningulongela ni chakaka na kyenikumanyika. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Wenga nkosi Agilipa ungumanya mighalu hagha, kwa nagha nahela holu hinu ninguwesa kulongela kuulongolo ghako. Kwaikiva hagha hyogha ni gha chakaka na yagholeka ng'ogha kwa kuhigha. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Nkosi Agilipa, ghuli, unguwamanya walota wa Sapanga wenga? Namanya yiwa unguwamanya.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Nkosi Agilipa akamyanga Paulo, “Unguliwachila kwa milandu hai mayangani utenighola nivile Mkilisito?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo akamyanga, “Namluwa Sapanga ivile kwa lipindi mayaghani au ngenju, ng'ogha wenga hela hata wogha wanguyoghanila lelu wawesi kumkwinila Yesu handa nenga, ila wakotoho kuwela na minyololu hai.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Hinu, Nkosi Agilipa pamonga na mkulu wa mmbwani Fesitusi, na Belinike na wala wogha wawelili pamonga na weni, wakagholoka. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pawawelili wakihuka, wakalongelana “Mundu hayu agholili ng'ogha kindu kingumpala ahovi au kihungo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Nkosi Agilipa, akamlongela Fesitusi, “Mundu hayu angewesa kulekwa ayendi, handa kaluwa ng'ogha masitaka ghaki yayoghanilwi na Kaisali Nkosi mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyeghwa kwa nkosi mkulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pailamulwa tuyendi mbaka mlima wa Italia, wamvikili Paulo pamonga na wawopwa ghangi pahi gha ugholokela wa Yulio avile mkulu wa watovangondo kukipinga kikemilwi “Kipinga kya Agusito.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tukwelili kyombo kikulunga kya mmasi kikemwa meli kihumili Adilamito kivile kinguyenda na kupitila kambi gha mlima wa Asia, tukatumbula mwanja. Alisitako, mwenikaya wa Makidonia kuhuma Tesalonike, avile pamonga na twenga. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Kilau ghaki meli ikagholoka kukambi gha mmbwani wa Sidoni. Yulio amgholelili Paulo ulungwana kwa kumleka ayendi kuwalola waghanja ghaki mani wangalimpegha vindu avipalili. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kuhuma kula tukayendelela na mwanja, ila kwaikiva liyegha livile linguwumba kwa makakala kuhika kuulongolo gha twenga, tukapitila kihughulu kya Kupulo kwaikiva mbandi hila liyegha liwelili mayaghani. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Hinu, tukahubhuka bahali gha Kilikia na Pamfilia, meli ikagholoka ku mmbwani waukema Mula, mmbwani wa Lukia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Kula yula mkulu awonili meli imonga kuhuma mmbwani Alekisandilia ivile inguyenda kumlima gha Italia, nagha akatukwelesa mghati.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kwa machuwa ngenju tuyendelelili na mwanja nyalinyali, kwa lung'ai tuhikili pabehi na mmbwani Nido. Kwaikiva liyegha livile lingutukingama, tukayendelela kuulongolo monga kwa monga tukapitila kihughulu wakikema Kilete pabehi na mbandi gha mmbwani iyingila mbahali waikema lasi gha Salimoni pavile liyegha lipongile. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tupitili mmbali ghaki nyalinyali tukahika mahala pakemilwi Kambi gha maha, pabehi na mmbwani wa Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Lipindi litali liwelili lipita, na hata machuwa gha kuwopa mulyo yawelili yapita hilahila mbaha ng'ogha kuwela na mwanja mbahali badili gha machuwa gha kuwopa, hinu Paulo akawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Watundamilwa, nalola yiwa mwanja hau kuhumila baha utevile gha lung'ai na tuteyaghamisa hindu vyogha vya mghati gha meli yeni pamonga na ukomu wa twenga.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ila yula mkulu wa watovangondo kamhyoghanila ng'ogha Paulo vila alongili. Hinu apalili kughola vila myendesa meli na mweni meli wailongile. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwaikiva kambi hila iwelili ng'ogha mahala pamaha kulikala lipindi lya lupepu, wandu watangala wapalili tuyendeleli na mwanja, ikiwesekana mbaka Foiniki. Foiniki ni kambi gha Kilete inguyendelela mbaka kusini magalibi na kasikazini magalibi, na kula wangewesa kulikala lipindi lya lupepu.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liyegha likalipa mubahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Kuulongolo liyegha liwela ng'ogha likalipa likatumbula kuwumba, na weni wakaliwachila yiwa wawesa kuyendelela na mwanja, hinu wakafughula ngoi waiwopili na kuyenda na mwanja pabehi nesu na Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Badili gha lipindi lihupi, Liyegha litopehu walikema “Liyegha lya Kasikazini-mashaliki” likatumbula kuwumba kuhuma kukihiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Meli ikatovwa na lila liyegha litopehu mmasi na kusindwa kusindana na lila liyegha, hinu tukaleka hila meli iyendi kula liyegha linguyenda. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Hinu patuwela tukipitila mbandu gha kusini gha Kihughulu kya bahali kinung'una wakikema Kauda, tuwesili kwa lung'ai kuwopa whatu na kuilokola. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Wala watumikila wa mmeli wakakwega whatu mghati gha meli, hinu wakaitindilila meli ngoi na kuiwopa kwa makakala. Watilili yiwa wangewesa kuwomela ku mbeku gha bahali, mmbali mwa bahali gha Libiya. Kwa nagha wahulusili lyuma litopehu gha kuwesesa meli kupungula kuyenda na kuileka meli iyendeswi na liyegha. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Tuwelili tungutovwa na liyegha mmasi kwa makakala, kilau ghaki watumbulili kutagha mihighu mubahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lichuwa lya itatu, wakatumbula kangi kutagha mubahali vindu vya meli kwa mawoku ghao wenibaha. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa machuwa ngenju tuwesa ng'ogha kulola lijuwa hata ndondwa, na liyegha likulunga likayendelela kutukola, hinu tukayaghamisa ukwinila wa ukomu.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Na pawawelili walikala lipindi litali na walyegha ng'ogha mulyo, Paulo akagholoka paghati ghao, akalonga, “Mwenga wandu iwapalili kuniyoghanila na kuleka mwanja mbahali kuhuma Kilete ikiva mngalighola nagha hagha hyogha yangalihumila ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ila hinaa ninguwaluwa mvile na moyu, kwahela hata mmonga wa mwenga ateyaghamisa ukomu ghaki ila meli hela ndiwa itejumbukila. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nenga ni mundu wa Sapanga kangi ni mtumikila ghaki lelo uhiku mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga yula avile nenga ni wa mweni na nenga ningumtundamila hayu Sapanga anihumilili, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />akanilongela, ‘Paulo ukotoho kutila! Ungupalwa ugholoki kuulongolo gha nkosi mkulu wa Loma Kaisali. Na mweni Sapanga, kwa upalo ghaki, kakuhighila kuwalokola wogha wavile kumwanja na wenga wakatoho kuyaghamila.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nagha, watundamilwa, mjitayi moyu! Kwaikiva ningumkwinila Sapanga hai itevile handa anilongelili. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ila hata nagha twenga tutewomela haku kuulongolo kukihiwa kitenu.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Uhiku wa lichuwa lya ikumi na njechi, patuwelili tunguyendelela kukulughulwa na liyegha kubahali gha Adilia. Paiwelili uhiku wa mandandu, watumikila mu meli wakawachila yiwa wawelili wanguhika pabehi gha mlima. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Nagha wakahakula utali wa masi kwa kuyenda pahi kwa kutumila ngoi ivile iwopwili kindu kitopeu, wakamanya utali ghaki mita ialobaini. Kuulongolo wakaghola kulola kangi na utali ghaki uvile mita ikumi itatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwaikiva gha kutila kuwomela kumaganga mubahali, wakahulusa vindu vitopehu vinjechi kuyetu gha meli kughola meli ikotoho kuyenda, wakaluwa kuweli malawila kwa uloposeli. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Watumikila mumeli wapalili kunyelembuka kwa kulihigha, na wayomolili kala kuhulusa hila whatu kumasi, wakighola handa vila wanguyenda kuhulusa vindu vitopehu vya kughola meli ikotoho kuyenda mbandi gha kuulongolo gha meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ila Paulo akamlongela yula mkulu wa watovangondo na wakovekela ghaki, “Ikiva hagha watumikila wa mumeli walema kulikala pamonga na twenga mmeli mtelokoka ng'ogha.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Pala wala watovangondo wakadumula ngoi zila ziwelili ziwopa whatu, na wakaileka itolwi na masi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Pabehi na malawila, Paulo akawalongela wogha walyeghi mulyo akilonga, “Kwa machuwa ikumi na njechi mlikala na holu na mlyegha ng'ogha mulyo wowosi. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Kwa nagha ninguwaluwa mlyeghi mulyo, kwaikiva utewatanga mwese kulama. Kwaikiva kwahela hata mmonga wa mwenga ateyalamila au kuhakilwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Paayomola kulonga ghala, Paulo akatola libumunda, akamshukwile Sapanga kuulongolo gha weni wogha, akaumetula, akatumbula kulyegha. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ndiwa wogha wakataywa moyu, wakatumbula kulyegha mulyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mghati gha meli tuwelili wandu imia ivili na ikumi isaba na isita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Pawayukwite wakapungula utopehu kwa kutagha mulyo mbahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meli ingutenyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Pakuwelili malawila, watumikila mumeli wawesa ng'ogha kumanya yiwa wavile kummbwani ghani, ila wawonili mbandu gha kihughulu kya mhanga, wakapala kuhulusa vindu vitopehu gha kugholokela meli kula handa ikiwesekana. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kwa nagha wakadumula ngoi zya vindu vitopehu na kuvileka vidubukili mubahali, lipindi lilalila wakawopola ngoi ziwelili ziwopa usukani, hinu wakakwelesa mghololi msokombi kuulongolo gha meli ili mghololi upingiki liyegha na wawesi kuyenda mmbali gha bahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ila wahikili mahala pavile bahali ivili zikongine, na meli ikawomela. Mbandu gha kuulongolo iwelili ihomela kumhanga itikanyika ng'ogha. Mbandu gha kuyetu gha meli ikatumbula kumetuka vipandi vipandi kwa kutovwa na maghaso gha masi gha bahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wala watovangondo wapalili kuwakoma wawopwa wogha kwa kutila yiwa wangewesa kuyovilela mbaka mmbali mwa bahali na kuyenda kwa kuhiha. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ila kwa vila yula mkulu wa watovangondo apalili kumlokola Paulo, akawakanisa wakotoho kughola nagha. Akalaghila wala wamanyili kuyovilela wajumbi kuhuma mumeli na kuyovilela mbaka mmbali gha bahali, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na wala ghangi wakovekeli wakijikolesa kweni mbau au kweni vipandi vya meli imetukili. Ndiwa twenga wogha tukahubhuka wakomu mmbali mwa bahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kukihiwa kya Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Patuhika tukiva wakomu mmbali mwabahali, ndiwa tumanyili yiwa lihina lya kila kihughulu ni Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wenikaya wa pala wawelili walungwana nesu kwa twenga. Ndonya ivile ingutumbula kutonya na kuwelili na lupepu, nagha wakakosa lyoto, wakatukema tutami na weni. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo awelili kalikungulila mhighu msokombi wa hanju akiva anguzivika kuliloto. Pala, kwaikiva gha lila lyoto, njoka kahuka ku hanju akalitindila kuliwoku lya Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wala wenikaya wa hila kambi pawamwonili yula njoka akining'inila kumawoku gha Paulo, wakalongelana, “Hayu itewesekana kuvile ni mkoma wandu, pamonga alokokili kuhuma mubahali, hinu mlungu angumuhipa mahakata ghaki.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ila Paulo akamputila yula njoka mghati gha lyoto na mweni kalumwa ng'ogha na yula njoka. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wala wandu wawelili wakiwachila yiwa atetupa na kuulongolo kuhova bwitu. Na pawamlolili kwa lipindi litali na kulola yiwa kakolwa ng'ogha na lolosi wakahyuka na kuilongela “Mweni ni mlungu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Hinu, pabehi na mbandu hila, pawelili na litawa likulunga lya mundu mmonga kilongosi wa kila kihughulu, akemilwi Pubulio, avile katupokela akatutumikila kwa ulungwana mkulunga kwa machuwa itatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tati ghaki Pubulio awelili mvina kukindanda, akiva anguvina uvina na kupweka mwahi. Paulo akayingila mghati ili kumlola na akamyupila kwa Sapanga na kumvikila mawoko kumutu na mweni akalama. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Mghalu hau pauhumila, wandu wogha wa mahala pala wala wawelili wavina wakahika na weni wakalamiswa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Wandu wakatupegha hupo weka weka, na lipindi tutumbula kangi mwanja wakavika mu meli vindu vyogha tuwelili tukivipala.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo anguhika Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Miehi miitatu kuulongolo tukatumbula mwanja kwa meli iwopilwi ku kihughulu lipindi lya lupepo . Hai iwelili meli kuhuma Alekisandalia iwelili na kilangihi kya milungu mavila waivili wangukemwa “Kasito na Palukisi.” <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tukahika kummbwani wa Silakusa, tukatama pala kwa machuwa itatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kilau ghaki tukayendelela na mwanja na tukahika Regio, lichuwa lya ipili, liyegha likalipa lya kuhuma kusini likawumba, na lichuwa lya ipili tukahika Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Kula tuwalolili walongu wamkwinila Kilisito ghangi wavile watuluwili tutami na weni kwa lipindi lya machuwa isaba. Na havi tukahika Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wakwinila wa kula Loma pawayoghanila habali zya twenga, wahikili mbaka Soku lya Apio na mahala pakemilwi Mighuta miitatu gha wahenja kutulola. Paulo paawawonili, akamshukwile Sapanga na akataywa moyu.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo haku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Patuhikili Ulumi, Paulo akalekwa alikali weka ghaki pamonga na mtovangondo mmonga wa kumgholokela.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Machuwa maitatu kuulongolo Paulo akawakema pamonga vilongosi wa kiyahudi wa mahala pala. Pawalikungulili, Paulo akawalongela, “Walongu ghangu, pamonga na yiwa nighola ng'ogha chochosi kihakata na hata kukingama mighalu gha dahile gha wagogolu wa twenga, nikamulilwi kula Yelusalemu na kuvikwa kumawoku gha Walumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Na weni pawanikonyili na kulola yiwa nivile ng'ogha na mahakata yoyosi, Walumi wakapala kunileka. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ila Wayahudi watenu wakingamili nikotoho kuwoposolwa, nikapala kuluwa kulamulwa kwa nkosi mkulu wa Loma, ila niwela ng'ogha na lilando lya kuwasitaki wandu wa mlima ghangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Hinu kwaikiva gha mghalu hau, niwakema mhiki kunilola na kulongela na nenga, kwaikiva niwopwa minyololu hai kuhumila na lilaghano lya Izilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Weni wakamlongela, “Twenga tupatile ng'ogha lihamba yoyosi kuhuma mmbwani Yudasia na kwahela mundu yeyosi mlongu yoyosi ahikili baha na kulonga chochosi au kihakata ugholili. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ila tungupala kuhyoghanila kuhuma kwa wenga mwenibaha mighalu yavile kumutu kwa wenga. Kwaikiva tumanyili twenga yiwa haki kipinga kingungingamwa kogha na kogha.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Hinu, wakalongelana lichuwa lya kukonganika na mweni, na wandu watangala wakahika kula awelili angulikala. Kuhuma malawila mbaka lumihi Paulo awalongelili na kuwaghalambulila habali gha unkosi wa Sapanga, akiyesa kuwaghola wakwinili habali gha Yesu kwa kutumila malaghililo na mayandiko gha walota wa Sapanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wamonga ghao wakwinilili milandu ghaki, ila ghangi wakwinilili ng'ogha. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Hinu, kukavile na masindano gha mawachilo paghati ghao Pawawelili wanguyenda zyao, Paulo pala akalonga mighalu hai, “Hinaa ni chakaka yala Mpumulo wa Sapanga awalongelili wagogolo wa mwenga kwa kumtumila mlota wa Sapanga Isaya paailongile.”<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Ailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“Uyendi kwa wandu hagha ukawalongeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">ni chakaka kuhyoghanila mteyoghanila ila mtemanya ng'ogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">mtevile na mihu gha kulola ila mtelola ng'ogha.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />“Kwaikiva mioyu gha wandu hagha ivile ikekenala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na mapulukilo ghao ni matopehu kuhyoghanila na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">weni wagubikilili mihu ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Ili wakotoho kulola kwa mihu ghao na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">kuhyoghanila kwa mapulukilo ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na wakamanya kwa mioyu ghao na kunihyukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na nenga ningaliwalamisa angulonga Bambu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Hinu Paulo akamalila kwa kulonga, “Imanyiki kwa mwenga yiwa habali gha ulokola hau wa Sapanga iyeghwili kutangaswa kwa wandu wavile Wayahudi ng'ogha, na weni wateyoghanila.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Na mweni Paulo paayomola kulonga milandu hagha, Wayahudi wakahuka kutali mayaghani wakiva wangukonyana mighalu ngenju weka weka weni kwa weni.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa machuva ivili Paulo alikalili kulighuta awelili apangili na kuhipa mwenibaha mapesa. Akawakema wandu wogha wahiki kumjambusa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Awelili akitangasa habali zya Unkosi wa Sapanga na kuvula mighalu gha Bambu Yesu Kilisito kwa makakala, na wamkanisa ng'ogha.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>